9rant, en d\u00e9placement, fait pour porter l'attention sur la th\u00e9matique de la migration et ses enjeux. Il est bas\u00e9 actuellement dans un ancien CARWASH \u00e0 Ixelles dans le quartier Matong\u00e9.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Lang-Levenstraat","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Lang-Levenstraat, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het Medex  bevindt zich pal in de Matongewijk. Je ontdekt er alles over migratie en de uitdagingen die ermee gepaard gaan. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Longue Vie, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Located in the heart of Matong\u00e9, the Medex (Ephemeral Museum of Exile) explores every facet of migration and its challenges. The museum takes its visitors on a journey to a new country every month, through a varied cultural programme.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Medex (mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","addre