seert voor het publiek.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Boghossian Foundation - Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"\r\nOpening of Villa Empain to the public according to several themes of organised activities and events (exhibitions, concerts, conferences, etc.) from 2010. La Fondation Boghossian has its international office in Villa Empain, on which restoration work began in 2008. With the Stoclet building, constructed by the Austrian architect Josef Hoffmann in 1911, Villa Empain is undoubtedly one of the finest masterpieces of Art Deco architecture in Brussels. In 1930, Baron Louis Empain, then aged 21 years, had this 2,500-metre-square mansion built on the prestigious Avenue des Nations, which was later renamed Avenue Franklin Roosevelt. He entrusted the building of this fine house to the Swiss architect Michel Polak, assisted by his colleague Alfred Hoch. The plan designed for Baron Empain on a 55-acre plot included a monumental villa with four fa\u00e7ades in polished granite, a garden surrounding a swimming pool ornamented with a pergola, and a caretaker's lodge. The modern and luxurious nature of this structure soon aroused enthusiasm and curiosity. It is true that the variety and quality of the materials used (marble, polished granite, bronze, wrought iron, stained-glass windows and precious woods), the sophistication of the details and the coherence of the whole thing with simple but imposing lines immediately contributed to its patrimonial value. \r\n  ","description_print":"A villa in Art Deco style which is now home to the Boghossion Foundation: a centre for art and dialogue between Oriental and Western culture.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Boghossian-Stiftung \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Die Anfang der 1930er-Jahre erbaute Villa Empain ist ein bemerkenswertes Beispiel der Art D\u00e9co-Architektur. Sie geh\u00f6rte einst einer der reichsten Familien Europas, die heute fast vollst\u00e4ndig verarmt ist. Die Villa steht seit 2007 unter Denkmalschutz.\r\n\r\nJugendstil, Art D\u00e9co und Moderne: Ihr Architekt Michel Polak (1885\u20131948) kombinierte Zierelemente des Br\u00fcsseler Jugendstils mit Formen der Moderne: Ein Gesamtkunstwerk, bei dem Formen und edle Materialien der eleganten Ausstattung untrennbar zu einer ungew\u00f6hnlichen und imposanten Einheit verschmelzen.\r\n\r\nVom drohenden Verfall zur aufwendigen Restaurierung: Nach der zwischenzeitlichen Nutzung als sowjetische Botschaft und als Studio des Fernsehsenders RTL wurde die Villa nach aufwendiger Restaurierung zur imposanten Kulisse der Kulturstiftung Fondation Boghossian.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain \u00e8 uno straordinario esempio di architettura Art Deco costruita all'inizio degli anni '30. Oggi ospita il Centro de'Art e Dialogo tra Oriente e Occidente....\r\n\r\nLa Villa Empain \u00e8 uno straordinario esempio di architettura Art Deco costruita all'inizio degli anni '30. Oggi ospita il Centro de'Art e Dialogo tra Oriente e Occidente.\r\nVilla Empain \u00e8 anche la sede internazionale della Fondazione Boghossian, che opera in molti paesi dal 1992.\r\nEdificio classificato dal 2007, \u00e8 stata interamente restaurata seguendo scrupolosamente le strutture originali.\r\n\r\nDa non perdere.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Villa Empain, Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain es un testigo destacado de la arquitectura Art d\u00e9co.\r\nConstruida a principios de los a\u00f1os 1930 y ubicada en el centro de la capital europea, se ha convertido en un Centro de Arte y de Di\u00e1logo imprescindible.\u00a0\r\n\r\nEs igualmente la sede internacional de la Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian, que trabaja en distintos pa\u00edses desde el a\u00f1o 1992. Declarado monumento en el a\u00f1o 2007, ha sido restaurando siguiendo los criterios del edificio original.\u00a0A fecha de hoy, alberga diferentes exposiciones y actividades.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":10918,"location":{"lat":50.80750954,"lon":4.38436842},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-24T03:05:44+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:29:22+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/75c13acb4b84af9e6b8a521e262418cafd533663.jpg","width":2048,"height":867,"ratio":2.36,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Family Matters","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-02","doors":null,"start":"11:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2023-03-03","doors":null,"start":"11:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2023-03-04","doors":null,"start":"11:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"d