an Eetvelde de l\u2019avenue Palmerston. D\u2019une simple envie de Mr Eetvelde d\u2019agrandir sa propri\u00e9t\u00e9,  le b\u00e2timent fini par \u00eatre pris \u00e0 bras le corps par l\u2019architecte. Avec une audacieuse fa\u00e7ade \u00e0 sa structure m\u00e9tallique apparente, une verri\u00e8re interne cr\u00e9ant un puit de lumi\u00e8re l\u00e9ch\u00e9 de courbes sensuelles, des espaces de vie modulables\u2026Horta prend plaisir \u00e0 innover. Non-loin de l\u00e0, la maison du sculpteur Pierre Braecke. Tout en gardant la patte Horta si caract\u00e9ristique, l\u2019architecte y joue la carte de la sobri\u00e9t\u00e9. C\u2019est \u00e9galement dans ce quartier, \u00e0 deux pas du Cinquantenaire  que l\u2019on peut admirer l\u2019une des premi\u00e8res r\u00e9alisations de Victor Horta,  un pavillon n\u00e9o-classique ! De quoi surprendre et de s\u2019interroger sur  l\u2019\u00e9volution artistique de cet architecte de g\u00e9nie.\r\n\r\nVisite guid\u00e9e organis\u00e9e sur mesure pour vous et votre groupe.\r\nPrix sur demande, possibilit\u00e9 d'y inclure la visite d'un int\u00e9rieur, d'adapter en formule teambuilding et\/ou encore avec nos guides costum\u00e9s...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"nl":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"en":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"de":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"it":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"sp":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"pt":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"},"cn":{"name":"Du square Ambiorix au Cinquantenaire: Horta du d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547233"}},"place":{"id":242040,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Hotel van Eetvelde & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue Palmerston, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Selon les dires de Horta lui-m\u00eame, le plan de cette maison, con\u00e7u en 1895, est le plus audacieux qu\u2019il ait dessin\u00e9\u2026 Et c\u2019est encore au profit d\u2019une personnalit\u00e9 qu\u2019il le fait, puisque le commanditaire, le baron Edmond van Eetvelde, est le secr\u00e9taire g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de l\u2019\u00c9tat ind\u00e9pendant du Congo \u2014 dans les faits v\u00e9ritable \u00ab ministre du Congo \u00bb \u2014, et donc un tr\u00e8s proche collaborateur du roi L\u00e9opold II. \r\n\r\nLe futur propri\u00e9taire r\u00e9clame \u00e0 l\u2019architecte une maison \u00ab pour sa famille \u00bb, mais comportant, au vu de ses obligations mondaines, un salon et une salle \u00e0 manger aussi grands que possible. \r\n\r\nLa maison offre la particularit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00eatre flanqu\u00e9e de deux autres \u00e9difices, de part et d\u2019autre : un immeuble \u00e0 sa gauche, devant \u00e0 la fois servir d\u2019agrandissement \u00e0 la maison initiale et de maison de location ; un b\u00e2timent \u00e0 sa droite, petite annexe \u00e0 l\u2019habitation principale. ","description_print":"","booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=LABAN&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=E4D8C982-7620-86BE-07B4-22D6FF0EFE20&lg=FR","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Van Eetveldehotel & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Palmerstonlaan","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Palmerstonlaan, 2","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Volgens Victor Horta zelf was het plan voor dit huis in 1895 het meest gedurfde dat hij ooit had ontworpen. De opdrachtgever was ook niet de eerste de beste: baron Edmond van Eetvelde was de secretaris-generaal van de onafhankelijke staat Congo - de 'minister van Congo', zeg maar - en dus een zeer naaste medewerker van koning Leopold II. \r\n\r\nDe toekomstige eigenaar vroeg de architect om een huis \u2018voor zijn gezin,\u2019 maar met een zo groot mogelijke woonkamer en eetkamer met het oog op zijn sociale verplichtingen. \r\n\r\nBijzonder is dat het huis in feite een drie-eenheid is. Het wordt geflankeerd door twee andere gebouwen: een gebouw links van het huis, dat zowel als uitbreiding van het oorspronkelijke huis als als huurhuis moest dienen, en een gebouw rechts van het huis, een klein bijgebouw bij het hoofdhuis. ","description_print":"","booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=LABAN&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=E4D8C982-7620-86BE-07B4-22D6FF0EFE20&lg=NL","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Van Eetvelde Hotel & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Avenue Palmerston, 2","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"According to Horta himself, the plans for this house, conceived in 1895, were the most audacious he ever drew. And he did so for a prominent figure, as the client, Baron Edmond van Eetvelde, was the Secretary General of the Independent State of Congo - in reality the unofficial 'Minister of the Congo' - and, therefore, a very close ally of King Leopold II. \r\n\r\nThe future owner asked the architect for a house 'for his family', but with as large a living room and dining room as possible, given his frequent social engagements. \r\n\r\nThe house is unusual in that it is flanked by two other buildings: a building to the left of it, which was intended to serve both as an extension to the original house and as a rental house and a building to the right of it, a small annex to the main house. ","description_print":"","booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=LABAN&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=E4D8C982-7620-86BE-07B4-22D6FF0EFE20&lg=EN","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Van Eetvelde Hotel & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Av. Palmerston","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Av. Palmerston, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Maison van Eetvelde ist ein bemerkenswertes Jugendstilbauwerk aus der Feder von Victor Horta, das 1895-1898 im Auftrag des Diplomaten Edmond Van Eetvelde erbaut wurde. Das Geb\u00e4ude z\u00e4hlt zum UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe.\r\n\r\nDas Geb\u00e4ude wurde 1895 von Edmond Van Eetvelde, seinerzeit Diplomat und Generalsekret\u00e4r im Kongo, in Auftrag gegeben. Sehenswert sind die Eisentr\u00e4ger aus Flacheisen (wie im Industriebereich) statt aus Schmiedeeisen, die Mosaike, der glas\u00fcberdachte Innenhof und die Blumenmotive des Esszimmers.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Van Eetvelde Hotel & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue Palmerston, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Van Eetvelde Hotel & LAB\u00b7An","address_street_name":"Avenue Palmerston","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website"