lles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":"Suivez le guide pour d\u00e9couvrir certains des plus belles des r\u00e9alisations Art Nouveau : H\u00f4tel Tassel, Maison Sander Pierron,  Maison Vinck , H\u00f4tel Max Hallet, H\u00f4tel Solvay, mus\u00e9e Horta\u2026 Un \u00e9merveillement architectural !","longdescr":"Au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, la r\u00e9putation de la Belgique faisait de Bruxelles un point de rencontre fastueux. \u00c0 la pointe de l'industrie m\u00e9tallurgique, premier producteur de voitures, sollicit\u00e9 de partout pour la construction ferroviaire, le pays attirait les grands de ce monde. \u00c0 l'invitation d\u2019Ernest Solvay -l'un de nos brillants capitaines d'industrie-, les prix Nobel (dont Einstein) se r\u00e9unissaient, par exemple, \u00e0 l'h\u00f4tel M\u00e9tropole. Le meilleur exemple de ce dynamisme est la naissance de l'Art Nouveau gr\u00e2ce au g\u00e9nial architecte Victor Horta.  \r\nC\u2019est \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles que l\u2019on peut voir certains des plus belles de ses r\u00e9alisations : H\u00f4tel Tassel, Maison Sander Pierron,  Maison Vinck , H\u00f4tel Max Hallet, H\u00f4tel Solvay, mus\u00e9e Horta\u2026 Un \u00e9merveillement architectural !\r\n\r\nVisite guid\u00e9e organis\u00e9e sur mesure pour vous et votre groupe.\r\nPrix sur demande, possibilit\u00e9 d'y inclure la visite d'un int\u00e9rieur, d'adapter en formule teambuilding et\/ou encore avec nos guides costum\u00e9s...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"nl":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"en":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"de":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"it":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"sp":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"pt":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"},"cn":{"name":"Horta, Solvay et les Autres: Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547232"}},"place":{"id":241873,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Le Mus\u00e9e Horta est install\u00e9 dans la maison et l'atelier de l'architecte Victor Horta (1861-1947). Les deux b\u00e2timents ont \u00e9t\u00e9 construits entre 1898 et 1901 et sont typiques de l'apog\u00e9e de l'Art nouveau. L'int\u00e9rieur de la maison a \u00e9t\u00e9 largement pr\u00e9serv\u00e9 : mosa\u00efques, vitraux, mobilier, peintures murales forment un ensemble harmonieux qui fait preuve de subtilit\u00e9 jusque dans les moindres d\u00e9tails. Le mus\u00e9e est \u00e9galement un centre de recherche sur Victor Horta et l'Art nouveau. Les archives personnelles de l'architecte, une collection de plans de ses b\u00e2timents et la biblioth\u00e8que sont accessibles au public sur rendez-vous. La r\u00e9servation d\u2019une plage d\u2019horaire en ligne est obligatoire. Dernier acc\u00e8s \u00e0 16h45.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hortamuseum","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 27","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Het Hortamuseum is gevestigd in het eigen huis en het atelier van architect Victor Horta (1861-1947). Deze gebouwen werden door de architect opgetrokken tussen 1898 en 1901 op het hoogtepunt van de art nouveau. Een groot deel van de interieurdecoratie bleef bewaard; de mosa\u00efeken, de glasramen, het meubilair, de muurschilderingen vormen een harmonisch en tot in het kleinste detail verzorgd geheel. Het museum is ook een onderzoekscentrum voor Victor Horta en de Art Nouveau. Het persoonlijke archief van de architect, een verzameling plannen van zijn gebouwen en de bibliotheek zijn op afspraak toegankelijk voor het publiek. De reservatie van een tijdsblok online is verplicht. Laatste toegang mogelijk om 16u45.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Museum Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"The Horta Museum is housed in the house and studio of the architect Victor Horta (1861-1947). Both buildings were built from 1898 to 1901 and are typical of the height of Art Nouveau. The interior of the house has been largely preserved: mosaics, stained-glass windows, furniture, wall paintings form a harmonious whole that shows subtlety down to the smallest detail. The museum is also a centre for research on Victor Horta and Art Nouveau. The architect's personal archive, a collection of plans of his buildings and the library are accessible to the public by appointment. Reservation of a time slot online is mandatory. Last access at 16:45.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Horta-Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die Geb\u00e4ude des heutigen Horta-Museum, das zum UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe z\u00e4hlt, wurde 1898 von dem ber\u00fchmten belgischen Jugendstilarchitekten Victor Horta auf zwei Parzellen der Br\u00fcsseler Rue Am\u00e9ricaine als Wohnhaus und Atelier erbaut. \r\n\r\nVon Arabesken und Licht: Der Jugendstilpionier erfand einen auf der Arabeske beruhenden Stil und revolutionierte den traditionellen Grundriss des b\u00fcrgerlichen Hauses. Mit der Konzeption eines Oberlichtes, das sich \u00fcber einem gro\u00dfr\u00e4umigen Treppenhaus befindet, brach er mit der Struktur des Hauses mit Bel-Etage und drei aneinander anschlie\u00dfenden, eher dunklen Zimmern. Au\u00dferdem nutzte er alle M\u00f6glichkeiten seines handwerklichen K\u00f6nnens und der Verwendung von industriellen Materialien wie Eisen, Gusseisen und Glas. \r\n\r\nHortas Anspruch war es, Kunst und Innenausstattung zu einem Gesamtkunstwerk zusammenzuf\u00fcgen, das das t\u00e4gliche Leben zu einer \u00e4sthetischen Erfahrung machte. Ganz sicher einer der Jugendstilh\u00f6hepunkte in Br\u00fcssel.\r\n\r\nDas Museum beherbergt gleichzeitig ein Forschungszentrum \u00fcber Victor Horta und den Jugendstil. Die pers\u00f6nlichen Archive Hortas, die Pl\u00e4ne seiner Bauten und die Bibliothek sind nach Vereinbarung zug\u00e4nglich.\r\n\r\nLetzter Einlass 17 Uhr.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Il Museo Horta ha sede nella casa privata e nello studio dell'architetto Victor Horta (1861-1947). Costruiti tra il 1898 e il 1901, i due edifici sono caratteristici dell'apice dell'Art Nouveau. La casa ha conservato gran parte del suo arredamento interno: mosaici, vetrate, mobili e pitture murali compongono un insieme armonico e raffinato nei minimi dettagli. Il museo \u00e8 anche un centro di ricerca su Victor Horta e Art Nouveau. Gli archivi personali dell'architetto, una collezione dei progetti dei suoi edifici e la biblioteca sono accessibili al pubblico su appuntamento.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"El Museo Horta se cre\u00f3 en el domicilio particular y el taller del arquitecto Victor Horta (1861-1947). Los dos edificios, construidos entre 1898 y 1901, son caracter\u00edsticos del apogeo del art nouveau. La casa ha conservado en gran parte su decoraci\u00f3n interior: mosaicos, vidrieras, mobiliario y murales forman un conjunto armonioso y refinado hasta el m\u00e1s m\u00ednimo detalle. El museo es tambi\u00e9n un centro de investigaci\u00f3n sobre Victor Horta y el art nouveau. Los archivos personales del arquitecto, una colecci\u00f3n de planos de sus edificios y la biblioteca est\u00e1n abiertos al p\u00fablico con cita previa.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Este museu reflete na perfei\u00e7\u00e3o o g\u00e9nio de Horta. Defendia uma arte total, que levou ao extremo: cada conceito de planeamento, cada pe\u00e7a de mob\u00edlia, cada detalhe de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o foi pensado minuciosamente pelo arquiteto para atingir o equil\u00edbrio e a perfei\u00e7\u00e3o, tanto do ponto de vista da est\u00e9tica como do espa\u00e7o.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Horta","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@hortamuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hortamuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 27","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[6],"translations":{"fr":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"nl":["Kasteleinswijk\/Baljuw"],"en":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"de":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"it":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"sp":["Ch\u00e2telain\/Bailli"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"],"de":["S\u00fcden"],"it":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":4331,"location":{"lat":50.82416798,"lon":4.35553156},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-25T02:08:55+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:17:16+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_expo