r":"La Bounce Session : savais -tu que c'est le nouveau concept qui te permet d'acc\u00e9der au vrai go\u00fbt du rap avec des artistes \u00e9mergents ?","longdescr":"Dans l'intimiste salle du Motown Concerts, la Bounce Session te fera vivre un moment incroyable dans son univers rap urbain. Des artistes comme @Baolebaobab, @Je\u00ffe, @Lokho, @Lusty, @LeLoupLdr vont mettre le feu au Motown.\r\nViens t'ambiancer ce mercredi 26 avril avec ton crew. Tu es seul(e) ? Saisie cette occasion pour rencontrer d'autres jeunes comme toi.\r\nR\u00e9serve vite ton billet pour le kiff !","performers":"Baolebaobab, Je\u00ffe, Lokho, Lusty, LeLoupLdr","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"nl":{"name":"Ontdek de \"Bounce Session\" in Brussel !","shortdescr":"The Bounce Session: wist je dat dit het nieuwe concept is dat je toegang geeft tot de echte smaak van rap met opkomende artiesten?","longdescr":"In de intieme zaal van Motown Concerts geeft de Bounce Session je een ongelooflijke ervaring in zijn urban rap-universum. Artiesten zoals @Baolebaobab, @Je\u00ffe, @Lokho, @Lusty, @LeLoupLdr zullen de Motown in vuur en vlam zetten.\r\nKom en krijg je groove op deze woensdag 26 april met je crew. Ben je alleen, grijp dan deze kans om andere jongeren zoals jij te ontmoeten.\r\nBoek nu je ticket voor het feest!\r\n\r\nVertaald met www.DeepL.com\/Translator (gratis versie)","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"en":{"name":"Discover the \"Bounce Session\" in Brussels !","shortdescr":"The Bounce Session: did you know that this is the new concept that allows you to access the real taste of rap with emerging artists?","longdescr":"In the intimate Motown Concerts room, the Bounce Session will make you live an incredible moment in its urban rap universe. Artists like @Baolebaobab, @Je\u00ffe, @Lokho, @Lusty, @LeLoupLdr will set the Motown on fire.\r\nCome and party this Wednesday, April 26th with your crew. If you're alone, take this opportunity to meet other young people like you.\r\nBook your ticket for the fun!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"de":{"name":"D\u00e9couvre la \"Bounce Session\" in Bruxelles !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"it":{"name":"D\u00e9couvre la \"Bounce Session\" in Bruxelles !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"sp":{"name":"D\u00e9couvre la \"Bounce Session\" in Bruxelles !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","email":"motown@creative-district.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 485 24 29 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555515"},"pt":{"name":"D\u00e9couvre la \"Bounce Session\" in Bruxelles !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.creative-district.be","emai