t exceptionnel, tout en vous plongeant dans des \u0153uvres immersives : photographies \u00e0 fluorescence, installation lumi\u00e8re, projections vid\u00e9o et deux exp\u00e9riences de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle pour tous les publics d\u00e8s 10 ans.","performers":"Laetitia Bica, Antoine De Schuyter, Tristan Bundler, Martin Wauti\u00e9, Marc Zimmermann, fomo.scene","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/resetimmersive.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551515"},"nl":{"name":"Reset Immersive","shortdescr":"Een meeslepende en zintuiglijke kunstzinnige reis in het hart van Brussel","longdescr":"Ontdek digitale kunstwerken zoals je ze nog nooit hebt gezien in een verlaten locatie in het centrum van Brussel! De tentoonstelling biedt een reis door een uitzonderlijk gebouw en dompelt je onder in adembenemende kunstwerken: fluorescerende foto's, lichtinstallaties, videoprojecties en twee VR-ervaringen voor publiek van alle leeftijden vanaf 10 jaar.","performers":"Laetitia Bica, Antoine De Schuyter, Tristan Bundler, Martin Wauti\u00e9, Marc Zimmermann, fomo.scene","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/resetimmersive.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551515"},"en":{"name":"Reset Immersive","shortdescr":"An immersive and sensory artistic journey in the heart of Brussels","longdescr":"Come discover digital artworks like you've never seen before in an abandoned location in the center of Brussels! The exhibition tour offers a journey through an exceptional building and immerses you in breathtaking artworks: fluorescence photographs, light installations, video projections and two VR experiences for audiences of all ages starting from 10 years old.","performers":"Laetitia Bica, Antoine De Schuyter, Tristan Bundler, Martin Wauti\u00e9, Marc Zimmermann, fomo.scene","boxoffice