n spaces 70\u2019s d\u2019une ancienne banque cal\u00e9e entre la cath\u00e9drale Saints-Michel-et-Gudule et Paccheco. Sur deux plateaux, cet espace \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re hybride accueille \u00e9v\u00e9nements nocturnes et diurnes tout en cultivant un esprit underground. Expositions d\u00e9di\u00e9es aux arts num\u00e9riques, soir\u00e9es \u00e9lectro, ateliers ou talks branch\u00e9s (dont un avec Laurent Garnier !), Reset a un bail de deux ans pour r\u00e9amorcer la nuit Bruxelloise ! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/www.reset.brussels"},"nl":{"name":"Reset","address_street_name":"de Lignestraat","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":"1000","email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.reset.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"de Lignestraat, 8\/1000","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Reset","address_street_name":"Rue de Ligne","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":"1000","email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.reset.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de Ligne, 8\/1000","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The non-profit Arty Farty Brussels has transformed the open 1970s spaces of a former bank located between the Cathedral of St Michael and St Gudula and the Institut Pacheco. With two levels, this hybrid temporary space with an underground vibe hosts events at night and during the day. These include digital arts exhibitions, electro nights, workshops, and talks (including one with Laurent Garnier!). Reset has a two-year lease during which to revive Brussels nightlife! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Reset","address_street_name":"Rue de Lign