ion_print":"Situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, proche du Quartier Europ\u00e9en, la galerie d\u2019art Comic Art Factory est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans l\u2019exposition, l\u2019achat et la vente de planches originales de bande dessin\u00e9e et d\u2019illustrations originales.\r\n\r\nQue vous soyez passionn\u00e9s de bande dessin\u00e9e, lectrice ou lecteur occasionnel, fan de BD franco-belge ou de comics am\u00e9ricains, nous vous proposons d\u2019acheter les planches BD et les illustrations originales d\u2019autrices et d\u2019auteurs de bande dessin\u00e9e, prometteurs ou confirm\u00e9s.\r\nNous proposons \u00e9galement un service de conseil pour celles et ceux qui souhaitent commencer une collection ou l\u2019affiner.\r\n\r\nNous sommes ouverts du jeudi au samedi, de 13 \u00e0 19h. Les autres jours sur rendez-vous. Nous vous recevrons avec plaisir, et partagerons avec vous notre passion pour le neuvi\u00e8me art.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Waversesteenweg","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"comicartfactory@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.comicartfactory.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waversesteenweg, 237","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"comicartfactory@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.comicartfactory.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Based in the heart of Brussels, close to the European District, the gallery specializes in the exhibition, sale and purchase of original comic and illustration art.\r\nWhether you\u2019ve been fond of comic books since childhood or are just discovering this fantastic medium, we offer a selection of more than a thousand pieces from well-known and up-and-coming comic book artists, both European and American. We also showcase the art of children\u2019s book illustrators.","description_print":"Based in the heart of Brussels, close to the European District, the Comic Art Factory gallery specializes in the exhibition, sale and purchase of original comic and illustration art.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019ve been fond of comic books since childhood or are just discovering this fantastic medium, we offer a selection of more than a thousand pieces from well-known and up-and-coming comic book artists, both European and American. We also showcase the art of children\u2019s book illustrators.\r\nWe offer consulting services on how to build a collection, and are always interested in buying great pieces of art.\r\n\r\nIt would be a pleasure to have you at our gallery, where you can see our passion for sequential art firsthand. We\u2019re open Thursday through Saturday, 1 PM to 7 PM, as well as other days by appointment.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"comicartfactory@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.comicartfactory.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"em