blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-07T22:06:04+02:00","published_at":"2023-03-17T13:16:14+01:00","backoffice_id":273706,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.5},{"id":555597,"date_start":"2023-04-29","date_end":"2023-05-14","date_next":"2023-04-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[95],"translations":{"fr":["Patrimoine"],"nl":["Erfgoed"],"en":["Heritage"],"de":["Kulturerbe"],"it":["Patrimonio culturale"],"sp":["Patrimonio"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":"Un jeu de piste \u00e0 faire en famille","longdescr":"Le petit Charles Quint a besoin de ton aide ! Il a oubli\u00e9 le code pour ouvrir son coffre au tr\u00e9sor. Dans ce coffre, se trouve quelque chose de tr\u00e8s sp\u00e9cial : son collier de l\u2019ordre de la Toison d\u2019or. Charles est \u00e0 la recherche de princesses et de princes valeureux pour l\u2019aider. Si tu r\u00e9ussis, Charles aura certainement une r\u00e9compense pour toi !\r\n\r\nComment \u00e7a se passe ?\r\nChaque enfant re\u00e7oit un sac \u00e0 dos avec du mat\u00e9riel pour effectuer des missions (carte au tr\u00e9sor, d\u00e9guisement, puzzle, lampe de poche\u2026). Chaque mission donne un indice pour trouver le mot de passe qui leur permettra d\u2019ouvrir le coffre au tr\u00e9sor (o\u00f9 se trouve le fameux collier de la Toison d\u2019or). Les enfants re\u00e7oivent un petit cadeau \u00e0 la fin du jeu.\r\n\r\nInformations pratiques\r\nQuand: vacances de P\u00e2ques, le 29 avril \u00e0 14 mai 2023 (vacances scolaires francophones). Tous les jours sauf le lundi\r\nTarifs : 4 \u20ac \/ enfant (+ adulte 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Article 27 : 1,25 \u20ac\r\nLangues : fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais, anglais et espagnol\r\nPublic : pour les enfants de 5 \u00e0 8 ans accompagn\u00e9s d\u2019un adulte\r\nR\u00e9servation en ligne possible\r\nActivit\u00e9 en autonomie, sans accompagnateur du Coudenberg\r\nDur\u00e9e : 1h - 1h30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"nl":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":"Een speurtocht voor het hele gezin","longdescr":"Klein keizer Kareltje heeft jouw hulp nodig! Hij is de code om zijn schatkist te openen vergeten. In die schatkist zit iets heel speciaals: de ketting van de orde van het Gulden Vlies. Kareltje zoekt dappere prinsen en prinsessen om de code te kraken. Durf jij mee op zoek te gaan in het ondergrondse paleis van de Coudenberg? Als je de schatkist kunt openen zal Kareltje je zeker belonen!\r\n\r\nHoe werkt het?\r\nElk kind krijgt een rugzakje met het nodige materiaal om de opdrachten uit te voeren (schatkaart, kostuum, puzzel, zaklamp\u2026). Elke opdracht geeft een aanwijzing om het woord te vinden dat de code is om de schatkist te openen (waarin de beroemde ketting van het Gulden Vlies zit). De kinderen krijgen een kleine verrassing op het einde van het spel.\r\n\r\nPraktische informatie\r\nWanneer: Paasvakantie, van 29 april tot 14 mei 2023 (schoolvakantie franstalig onderwijs). Elke dag behalve maandag\r\nTarief: 4 \u20ac \/ kind (+ volwassene 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Artikel 27 : 1,25 \u20ac\r\nTalen : Nederlands, Frans, Engels\r\nDoelgroep : voor kinderen van 5 tot 8 jaar onder begeleiding van een volwassene.\r\nOnline reservatie mogelijk. Bel + 32 (0)2 500 45 54 bij problemen.\r\nZelfstandige activiteit, zonder begeleider van de Coudenberg\r\nDuur : 1u\/1u30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"en":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":"A treasure hunt for the whole family","longdescr":"Little Charles V needs your help! He has forgotten the code to open his treasure chest. And there\u2019s something very special in that chest: his collar of the order of the Golden Fleece. Little Charles is looking for tough princes and princesses to crack the code. If you succeed, no doubt Charles will reward you!\r\n\r\nHow does it work?\r\nEvery child receives a backpack with the equipment to complete missions (treasure map, fancy dress, puzzle, flashlight...). Every mission gives a clue to find the password that will allow them to open the treasure chest (where the famous collar of the Golden Fleece is). The children receive a small gift at the end of the game.\r\n\r\nPractical information\r\nWhen: Easter vacations, from 29th of April-14th of May 2023, except for Mondays\r\nPrices: 4 \u20ac \/ child (+ adult 10 \u20ac, senior 8 \u20ac). Article 27: \u20ac1.25. Members Gezinsbond: children -14 years old: \u20ac2 \/ adultes: \u20ac5\r\nLanguages: French, Dutch, English and Spanish\r\nPublic: suitable for children from 5 to 8 years old accompanied by an adult.\r\nOnline reservation possible. Self-guided activity, without a Coudenberg guide\r\nDuration: 1h - 1h30","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"de":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"it":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"sp":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"pt":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"},"cn":{"name":"Ondergrondse speurtocht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555597"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"],"en":["Royal"],"de":["K\u00f6nigliches Viertel"],"it":["Quartiere reale"],"sp":["Quartier Royal \u2014Barrio de la Corte\u2014"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":18195,"location":{"lat":50.84261029,"lon":4.36068879},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-18T12:35:06+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-05T10:58:29+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":258195,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die 