 de Bruxelles \u00e0 travers une s\u00e9rie d'\u00e9v\u00e8nements artistiques, culturels et culinaires.","longdescr":"A partir de mi-avril, on fait escale en Gr\u00e8ce pour une s\u00e9rie d'\u00e9v\u00e8nements musicaux, po\u00e9tiques et artistiques co-cr\u00e9\u00e9s avec des Grecs, artistes et non-artistes, qui habitent \u00e0 Bruxelles. \r\n\r\nConcerts, banquet philosophique et performatif, atelier cuisine, initiation aux chants traditionnels... ne manquez pas l'une de ces occasions de voguer sur la douceur de vivre \u00e0 la grecque !","performers":"Panos Gourgiotis ; Giouli (voix) ; Asimina Karamperopoulou (voix) ; Antonis Moutselos (violon) ; Renaud Dardenne (guitare)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"nl":{"name":"Le Greek Club - La Gr\u00e8ce se raconte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"en":{"name":"Le Greek Club - La Gr\u00e8ce se raconte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"de":{"name":"Le Greek Club @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"it":{"name":"Le Greek Club @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"sp":{"name":"Le Greek Club @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"pt":{"name":"Le Greek Club @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"},"cn":{"name":"Le Greek Club @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554379"}},"place":{"id":265418,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Medex (Mus\u00e9e \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de l'exil)","address_street_name":"Rue Longue Vie","address_street_number":"34A","address_street_box":null,"email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com","phone_contact":"+32 488 50 60 42","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Longue Vie, 34A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Un mus\u00e9e qui n\u2019en est pas un, un mus\u00e9e valise qui porte une vision de la culture dans diff\u00e9rents endroits le temps d\u2019une exposition, d\u2019une performance ou d\u2019un \u00e9v\u00e9nement. \r\n\r\nLe Medex est un mus\u00e9e itin\u00e