om 12:00 to 18:00"]},"date_start":"2023-03-16","date_end":"2023-04-29","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"opening":{"day":"2023-03-16","start":"18:00:00","timestamp":"2023-03-16T18:00:00+01:00","end":"21:00:00","is_only_by_appointment":false},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-23T03:38:09+02:00","published_at":"2023-03-10T13:35:57+01:00","backoffice_id":273168,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.3568829277518},{"id":555520,"date_start":"2023-04-18","date_end":"2023-05-31","date_next":"2023-04-25","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,37],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts audiovisuels"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Audiovisuele kunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Audiovisual art"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Audiovisuelle K\u00fcnste"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Arti audiovisive"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Artes audiovisuales"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo","shortdescr":"La propagande coloniale belge d\u00e9voil\u00e9e","longdescr":"Du 18 avril au 31 mai 2023, le MigratieMuseumMigration, en collaboration avec le CEC-ONG, organise l\u2019exposition \u201cNotre Congo\/Onze Kongo\u201d. Cette exposition porte sur la propagande coloniale belge. Comment ont-ils justifi\u00e9 la colonisation aupr\u00e8s du grand public ? Cette exposition montre comment diff\u00e9rents canaux ont \u00e9t\u00e9 utilis\u00e9s pour y parvenir. La diffusion d\u2019images et de slogans a contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 fa\u00e7onner un imaginaire collectif dont les vestiges sont encore tr\u00e8s pr\u00e9sents dans notre soci\u00e9t\u00e9. On les retrouve dans les monuments, mais aussi dans les st\u00e9r\u00e9otypes sur la communaut\u00e9 congolaise et plus g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement sur les afro-descendants. Cette exposition vise \u00e9galement \u00e0 susciter une r\u00e9flexion sur ces repr\u00e9sentations et ce qu\u2019il en reste.\r\n\r\nNous invitons les groupes scolaires \u00e0 visiter cette exposition dans le cadre de leurs cours d\u2019histoire, de g\u00e9ographie, de citoyennet\u00e9 et de langues. Des ateliers et des pr\u00e9sentations seront organis\u00e9s tout au long de l\u2019exposition pour permettre la discussion avec les \u00e9l\u00e8ves et les \u00e9tudiants.\r\n\r\nLes visites libres (sans guide) co\u00fbtent 5 euros par \u00e9l\u00e8ve.\r\n\r\nLes ateliers co\u00fbtent 8 euros par participant.\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servation :\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Dominique Guillerot (cec-ong)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"nl":{"name":"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo","shortdescr":"De Belgische koloniale propaganda ontsluierd","longdescr":"Van 18 april tot 31 mei 2023 organiseert het MigratieMuseumMigration in samenwerking met het CEC-ONG de tentoonstelling \u201cNotre Congo\/Onze Kongo\u201d. Deze tentoonstelling gaat over de Belgische koloniale propaganda. Hoe rechtvaardigde men de kolonisatie bij het grote publiek? Deze tentoonstelling laat zien hoe verschillende kanalen daarvoor werden ingezet. De verspreiding van beelden en slogans droeg bij tot de vorming van een collectieve verbeelding waarvan de overblijfselen nog steeds zeer aanwezig zijn in onze maatschappij. We vinden ze terug in monumenten, maar ook in stereotypen over de Congolese gemeenschap en meer in het algemeen over Afro-afkomstigen. Deze tentoonstelling wil ook een reflectie op gang brengen over deze voorstellingen en wat ervan overblijft.\r\n\r\nWij nodigen schoolgroepen uit om deze tentoonstelling te bezoeken als onderdeel van hun lessen geschiedenis, aardrijkskunde, burgerschap en taal. Gedurende de tentoonstelling zullen workshops en presentaties worden gehouden om discussie met leerlingen en studenten mogelijk te maken.\r\n\r\nDe vrije bezoeken (zonder gids) kosten 5 euro per leerling.\r\n\r\nDe workshops kosten 8 euro per deelnemer.\r\n\r\nReservaties:\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Dominique Guillerot (cec-ong)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"en":{"name":"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo","shortdescr":"Belgian colonial propaganda revealed","longdescr":"The MigratieMuseumMigration will host from 18 April to 31 May 2023 an exhibition in collaboration with CEC-ONG \u201cNotre Congo\/Onze Kongo\u201d. This exhibition focuses on the Belgian colonial propaganda. Through iconographic documents and videos from the colonial period, the exhibition aims to understand how the different propaganda channels justified colonisation to the general public. The dissemination of images and slogans contributed to the shaping of a collective imagination still very present in our societies through monumental vestiges and stereotypes about the Congolese community and more broadly about Afro-descendants. This exhibition also aims to initiate a reflection on these representations.\r\n\r\nWe invite school groups to visit this exhibition as part of their history, geography, social science and language courses. Workshops and presentations will be held throughout the exhibition to allow for discussion with pupils and students.\r\n\r\nSelf-guided tours (without a guide) cost 5 euros per student.\r\n\r\nWorkshops cost 8 euros per participant.\r\n\r\nReservations:\r\n+32 2 609 55 61 museum@foyer.be","performers":"Dominique Guillerot (cec-ong)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"de":{"name":"EXPO \"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"it":{"name":"EXPO \"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"sp":{"name":"EXPO \"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"pt":{"name":"EXPO \"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"},"cn":{"name":"EXPO \"Notre Congo\/Onze Kongo\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555520"}},"place":{"id":274307,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Aujourd'hui, plus de 180 nationalite\u0301s vivent ensemble a\u0300 Bruxelles. Le MigratieMuseumMigration raconte l\u2019histoire de la premie\u0300re ge\u0301ne\u0301ration de travailleurs immigre\u0301s invite\u0301s, des premiers arrivants au Petit Cha\u0302teau, des expatrie\u0301s, des re\u0301fugie\u0301s de guerre, des Europe\u0301ens qui se sont de\u0301place\u0301s librement au sein de l\u2019UE et de tous les autres. C\u2019est un muse\u0301e chaleureux ou\u0300 les visiteurs peuvent de\u0301couvrir la ville et la vie des autres a\u0300 travers des souvenirs, mais aussi, et avant tout, un lieu accueillant pour y partager sa propre histoire.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"Werkhuizenstraat","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Werkhuizenstraat, 17","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Vandaag de dag wonen meer dan 180 nationaliteiten samen in Brussel. Het MigratieMuseumMigration geeft de verhalen van de eerste generatiegastarbeiders, van de vroegste bewoners van het Klein Kasteeltje, van de expats, de oorlogsvluchtelingen, de Europeanen die zich vrij bewegen binnen de EU en vele anderen een permanente thuis. Het is een warme omgeving waar bezoekers via herinneringen en kunst op ontdekking gaan in Brussel en in het leven van anderen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Today, more than 180 nationalities live together in Brussels. The MigratieMuseumMigration gives a permanent home to the stories of the first generation of guest workers, of the earliest inhabitants of the Petit-Cha\u0302teau, of the expats, the war refugees, the Europeans who move freely within the EU and many others. It is a warm environment where visitors can discover Brussels and the lives of others through memories and souvenirs. Above all, it is a museum with plenty of room to share your own story.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2