03-24","date_end":"2023-06-25","date_next":"2023-04-25","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":"LE PALACE ACCUEILLE L\u2019EXPOSITION ROMY SCHNEIDER !\r\n\r\nVenez d\u00e9couvrir le parcours unique d\u2019une grande figure du cin\u00e9ma europ\u00e9en \u00e0 travers quelques 250 \u0153uvres : photos, affiches, robes, vid\u00e9os \u2026\r\n\r\nRomy Schneider ayant une des filmographies les plus riches et les plus impressionnantes de l\u2019histoire du cin\u00e9ma, nous aurons grand plaisir \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter certains de ses films les plus embl\u00e9matiques.","longdescr":"Quarante ans apr\u00e8s sa disparition, Romy Schneider (23 septembre 1938 \u2013 29 mai 1982) est toujours aussi aim\u00e9e et populaire. Actrice europ\u00e9enne, avec une carri\u00e8re d\u00e9but\u00e9e \u00e0 15 ans en Allemagne et poursuivie en France, elle est devenue une star gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des films qui ont marqu\u00e9 \u00e0 jamais l\u2019histoire du cin\u00e9ma.\r\n\r\nL\u2019exposition montre comment la carri\u00e8re de Romy Schneider a \u00e9crit une histoire du cin\u00e9ma de son \u00e9poque, celle des grands cin\u00e9astes du monde entier. Sa qu\u00eate d\u2019absolu a sans doute contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 son g\u00e9nie et \u00e0 sa gr\u00e2ce. L\u2019exposition est l\u2019occasion de lui redonner la parole. Tenter de la faire revivre \u00e0 travers ses r\u00f4les bien s\u00fbr mais aussi ses textes, ses interviews \u2026\r\n\r\nConstruite \u00e0 la fois de mani\u00e8re chronologique et th\u00e9matique, l\u2019exposition s\u2019attache \u00e0 montrer le parcours atypique de l\u2019actrice : son enfance et ses d\u00e9buts en Autriche, sa fuite vers la France, sa rencontre avec les grands r\u00e9alisateurs (Visconti, Welles, Clouzot, Preminger \u2026), sa collaboration durable avec Claude Sautet, son influence et son implication grandissantes sur le choix de ses r\u00f4les\u2026\r\n\r\nL\u2019exposition s\u2019articule en un m\u00e9lange d\u2019objets (robes, accessoires \u2026), de photos, de textes, de documents de tournage mais aussi de pi\u00e8ces personnelles (lettres, carnets \u2026) et bien s\u00fbr de nombreux extraits vid\u00e9o.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"nl":{"name":"Expo Romy Schneider","shortdescr":"PALACE ONTVANGT DE ROMY SCHNEIDER TENTOONSTELLING!\r\n\r\nKom en ontdek de unieke carri\u00e8re van een grootheid uit de Europese cinema aan de hand van ongeveer 250 kunstwerken: foto's, posters, jurken, video's ... \r\n\r\nRomy Schneider heeft een van de rijkste en meest indrukwekkende filmografie\u00ebn in de cinemageschiedenis. Wij presenteren met veel plezier enkele van haar meest emblematische films.","longdescr":"Veertig jaar na haar overlijden is Romy Schneider (23 september 1938 - 29 mei 1982) nog steeds even geliefd en populair. De Europese actrice begon haar carri\u00e8re op 15-jarige leeftijd in Duitsland en trok vervolgens naar Frankrijk. Daar werd ze een ster dankzij een reeks films die de geschiedenis van het medium voor eeuwig hebben getekend.\r\n\r\nDe tentoonstelling laat zien hoe de loopbaan van Romy Schneider een eigentijdse filmgeschiedenis schreef, door haar samenwerkingen met de grootste internationale cineasten. Haar zoektocht naar het sublieme droeg ongetwijfeld bij tot haar genie en haar elegantie. De expo geeft Schneider het woord en probeert haar weer tot leven te brengen, via haar acteerprestaties (uiteraard) maar ook via haar teksten, interviews en nog veel meer.\r\n\r\nDe opbouw van de tentoonstelling is zowel chronologisch als thematisch, en leidt de bezoeker door Schneiders atypische carri\u00e8re: haar jeugd en eerste stappen als actrice in Duitsland en Oostenrijk, haar vlucht naar Frankrijk, haar ontmoetingen met de grote regisseurs van die tijd (Visconti, Welles, Clouzot, Preminger,\u2026), haar vaste samenwerking met Claude Sautet, haar groeiende invloed en betrokkenheid bij de keuze van haar rollen,\u2026\r\n\r\nDe expo omvat allerlei uiteenlopende elementen, van diverse voorwerpen (jurken, accessoires, enz), foto\u2019s, teksten, documenten van de opnames, maar ook persoonlijke stukken (zoals brieven en notitieboekjes) en natuurlijk talloze videofragmenten.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"en":{"name":"Exhibition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":"PALACE WELCOMES THE ROMY SCHNEIDER EXHIBITION!\r\n\r\nCome and discover the unique career of a great figure of European cinema through some 250 works: photos, posters, dresses, videos ...\r\n\r\nRomy Schneider has one of the richest and most impressive filmographies in the history of cinema. We will have great pleasure in presenting some of her most emblematic films.","longdescr":"Forty years after her death, Romy Schneider (September 23, 1938 - May 29, 1982) is still loved and popular. A European actress, with a career that began at the age of 15 in Germany and continued in France, she became a star thanks to films that have forever marked the history of cinema.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition shows how Romy Schneider's career has written a history of cinema of her time, that of the great filmmakers of the world. Her quest for the absolute undoubtedly contributed to her genius and grace. The exhibition is an opportunity to give her a voice. To try to make her live again through her roles of course but also her texts, her interviews...\r\n\r\nBuilt both chronologically and thematically, the exhibition aims to show the atypical path of the actress: her childhood and her beginnings in Austria, her flight to France, her meeting with great directors (Visconti, Welles, Clouzot, Preminger ...), her lasting collaboration with Claude Sautet, her influence and her growing involvement in the choice of her roles ...\r\n\r\nThe exhibition is articulated in a mixture of objects (dresses, accessories ...), photos, texts, documents of shooting but also personal pieces (letters, notebooks ...) and of course many video clips.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"de":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"it":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"sp":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"pt":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"},"cn":{"name":"Exposition Romy Schneider","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 514 52 97","phone_booking":"+32 2 514 52 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554338"}},"place":{"id":270775,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un nouveau lieu au coeur de Bruxelles alliant films d'auteur, cuisine locale et de saison, et \u00e9v\u00e8nements culturels. \r\n\r\nUN CIN\u00c9MA POUR TOUS. Palace souhaite s\u2019adresser \u00e0 tous les publics, des cin\u00e9philes avertis aux professionnels en passant par ceux qui int\u00e8grent une sortie cin\u00e9ma dans un programme occasionnel complet compos\u00e9 d\u2019un d\u00eener, d\u2019une projection et d\u2019un \u00ab dernier \u00bb verre. \r\nPalace ouvre ses portes \u00e0 tous les publics qui font vivre le centre-ville, qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de la population multiculturelle des quartiers Sud, des publics scolaires du bas de la ville ou des acteurs associatifs qui consid\u00e8rent le cin\u00e9ma comme une force d\u2019\u00e9ducation permanente. Et parce que son infrastructure a \u00e9t\u00e9 enti\u00e8rement pens\u00e9e pour accueillir tout le monde sans exception, Palace invite \u00e9galement les personnes \u00e0 mobilit\u00e9 r\u00e9duite \u00e0 vivre la magie du Septi\u00e8me Art sans aucune restriction d\u2019acc\u00e8s.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een nieuwe plek voor art house films, lokale gastronomie en evenementen in het centrum van Brussel. \r\n\r\nEEN BIOSCOOP VOOR IEDEREEN\r\nPalace wenst zich uitdrukkelijk te richten tot elk publiek. Zowel de cinefiel, de filmprofessional als zij die op zoek zijn naar een gezellig avondje uit of een leuke familieuitstap, kunnen in Palace terecht voor hun filmbeleving.\r\nIedereen is welkom in Palace. We openen onze deuren voor elk publiek dat het centrum van de stad doet leven, of het nu gaat om de multiculturele bevolking van de wijken in het zuiden, een schoolpubliek uit de laagstad of actoren uit het verenigingsleven die film beschouwen als een bron van educatie en inspiratie. Bovendien is Palace perfect toegankelijk voor mensen met een beperkte mobiliteit.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A new spot for art house films, local food and events in the center of Brussels. \r\n\r\nA CINEMA FOR EVERYONE\r\nPalace is intended to cater for everyone, from film buffs to professionals, along with visitors whose occasional trips to the cinema form part of a full programme comprising a dinner and a movie, followed by a drink to round off the evening.\r\nPalace will open its doors to all the communities who breathe life into the centre of the city : the multicultural populations in the southern district, the schoolchildren in the Lower Town and the associative actors who see the cinema as a permanent force for education. And, as its entire infrastructure has been designed to welcome everyone without exception, Palace also invites visitors with limited mobility to experience the magic of the \u201cSeventh Art\u201d, ensuring that they have\r\nunrestricted access.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein neues Kino im Herzen von Br\u00fcssel mit Autorenkino in Originalversion, lokaler und jahreszeitlicher K\u00fcche und kulturellen Veranstaltungen.\r\n\r\nEin Kino f\u00fcr alle: Das Palace m\u00f6chte ein bunt gemischtes Publikum erreichen, von Filmkennern bis zum Laien, von dem multikulturellen Publikum rund um den Gare du Midi \u00fcber die umliegenden Schulen bis hin zu den Vereinen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":30775,"location":{"lat":50.84777637,"lon":4.34870474},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-25T02:36:41+02:00","published_at":"2018-02-13T10:01:13+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":270775,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un nouveau lieu au coeur de Bruxelles alliant films d'auteur, cuisine locale et de saison, et \u00e9v\u00e8nements culturels. \r\n\r\nUN CIN\u00c9MA POUR TOUS. Palace souhaite s\u2019adresser \u00e0 tous les publics, des cin\u00e9philes avertis aux professionnels en passant par ceux qui int\u00e8grent une sortie cin\u00e9ma dans un programme occasionnel complet compos\u00e9 d\u2019un d\u00eener, d\u2019une projection et d\u2019un \u00ab dernier \u00bb verre. \r\nPalace ouvre ses portes \u00e0 tous les publics qui font vivre le centre-ville, qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de la population multiculturelle des quartiers Sud, des publics scolaires du bas de la ville ou des acteurs associatifs qui consid\u00e8rent le cin\u00e9ma comme une force d\u2019\u00e9ducation permanente. Et parce que son infrastructure a \u00e9t\u00e9 enti\u00e8rement pens\u00e9e pour accueillir tout le monde sans exception, Palace invite \u00e9galement les personnes \u00e0 mobilit\u00e9 r\u00e9duite \u00e0 vivre la magie du Septi\u00e8me Art sans aucune restriction d\u2019acc\u00e8s.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een nieuwe plek voor art house films, lokale gastronomie en evenementen in het centrum van Brussel. \r\n\r\nEEN BIOSCOOP VOOR IEDEREEN\r\nPalace wenst zich uitdrukkelijk te richten tot elk publiek. Zowel de cinefiel, de filmprofessional als zij die op zoek zijn naar een gezellig avondje uit of een leuke familieuitstap, kunnen in Palace terecht voor hun filmbeleving.\r\nIedereen is welkom in Palace. We openen onze deuren voor elk publiek dat het centrum van de stad doet leven, of het nu gaat om de multiculturele bevolking van de wijken in het zuiden, een schoolpubliek uit de laagstad of actoren uit het verenigingsleven die film beschouwen als een bron van educatie en inspiratie. Bovendien is Palace perfect toegankelijk voor mensen met een beperkte mobiliteit.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A new spot for art house films, local food and events in the center of Brussels. \r\n\r\nA CINEMA FOR EVERYONE\r\nPalace is intended to cater for everyone, from film buffs to professionals, along with visitors whose occasional trips to the cinema form part of a full programme comprising a dinner and a movie, followed by a drink to round off the evening.\r\nPalace will open its doors to all the communities who breathe life into the centre of the city : the multicultural populations in the southern district, the schoolchildren in the Lower Town and the associative actors who see the cinema as a permanent force for education. And, as its entire infrastructure has been designed to welcome everyone without exception, Palace also invites visitors with limited mobility to experience the magic of the \u201cSeventh Art\u201d, ensuring that they have\r\nunrestricted access.","description_p