xt":"2023-04-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,40],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts graphiques"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Grafische kunst, vormgeving"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Graphic art"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Grafische K\u00fcnste"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Arti grafiche"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Artes gr\u00e1ficas"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en","es"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":"Et si l'intelligence artificielle interpr\u00e9tait l'Art nouveau?","longdescr":"A la fin de sa vie, Victor Horta  missionne un ing\u00e9nieur papetier pour d\u00e9truire quelques 800kg de  ses inestimables archives.\r\nEt si nous avions retrouv\u00e9 la trace  d\u2019un des carnets d\u2019Horta ? Et si des  esquisses d\u2019Horta jamais r\u00e9alis\u00e9es, peut-\u00eatre m\u00eame irr\u00e9alisables, ressurgissaient aujourd\u2019hui.\r\nLe premier volet de cette  exposition laboratoire,  pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e aux Halles  Saint-G\u00e9ry et propos\u00e9e  par l\u2019association Atabey  \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de l\u2019Ann\u00e9e  de l\u2019Art nouveau 2023, a  \u00e9t\u00e9 imagin\u00e9 et r\u00e9alis\u00e9 en  quelques jours \u00e0 l\u2019aide  d\u2019outils g\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs d\u2019images et de textes...\r\n\r\nNous vous invitons ici  \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience, une  plong\u00e9e intrigante dans  les imaginaires Art nouveau de l\u2019Intelligence artificielle. Tout commence avec une  commande : \u2018\/imagine prompt\u2019","performers":"Asbl Atabey, ChatGPT, Midjourney","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"nl":{"name":"Het verloren notitieboekje van Victor Horta","shortdescr":"Wat als kunstmatige intelligentie Art Nouveau zou interpreteren?","longdescr":"Aan het einde van zijn leven gaf Victor Horta, de Belgische architect aan wie we enkele van de mooiste werken van de Art Nouveau te danken hebben, een papieringenieur de opdracht om zo\u2019n 800 kg van zijn onschatbare archieven te vernietigen van zijn werk.\r\nWat als we een van Horta\u2019s notitieboekjes hadden gevonden? Wat als nooit gerealiseerde, misschien zelfs onrealiseerbare schetsen van Horta vandaag de dag weer opduiken?\r\n\r\nHet eerste deel van deze laboratoriumtentoonstelling, gepresenteerd in de Sint-Gorikshallen\r\nen voorgesteld door de Atabey-vereniging ter gelegenheid van het Jaar van de Art Nouveau 2023, werd in enkele dagen bedacht en geproduceerd met behulp van tools beeld- en tekstgeneratoren...\r\nWe nodigen je hier uit voor een ervaring, een intrigerende duik in de Art Nouveau-imaginaties van kunstmatige intelligentie. Het begint allemaal met een commando:\r\n\u2018\/imagine prompt\u2019","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"en":{"name":"The lost notebook of Victor Horta","shortdescr":"What if artificial intelligence interpreted Art Nouveau?","longdescr":"At the end of his life, Victor Horta, the Belgian architect to whom we owe some of the finest works of Art Nouveau, commissioned a paper engineer to destroy some 800 kg of his invaluable archives.\r\nWhat if we had tracked down one of Horta\u2019s notebooks? What if never-realized, perhaps even unrealizable sketches of Horta resurface today?\r\n\r\nThis laboratory exhibition, presented at the Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry and proposed by the Atabey association on the occasion of the Year of Art Nouveau 2023, was imagined and produced in a few days using tools image and text generators...\r\n\r\nWe invite you here to an experience, an intriguing dive into the Art Nouveau imaginaries of Artificial Intelligence. It all starts with a command: \u2018\/imagine prompt\u2019","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"de":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"it":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"sp":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"pt":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"},"cn":{"name":"Le carnet perdu de Victor Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555508"}},"place":{"id":247371,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintg