appointment":false},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Assistenzhund","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-23T03:37:23+02:00","published_at":"2023-02-08T16:04:22+01:00","backoffice_id":271274,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.32548726473767},{"id":555048,"date_start":"2023-04-01","date_end":"2023-05-28","date_next":"2023-04-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,41],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Installation, performance"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Installatie, performance"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Installation, performance"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Installation, Performance"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Installazioni, performance"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Instalaci\u00f3n, performance"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":"Je suis un trac\u00e9 mythique pour tous les fans de sport automobile. Je f\u00eate mon centenaire cette ann\u00e9e. Qui suis-je ? Le Circuit du Mans, \u00e9videmment !\r\nEn l\u2019honneur de cet anniversaire incontournable et en guise d\u2019\u00e9chauffement, Autoworld pr\u00e9sente son exposition \u00ab 24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history \u00bb, du 1er avril au 28 mai 2023 inclus.","longdescr":"Les autos expos\u00e9es ont \u00e9t\u00e9 s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9es avec soin pour repr\u00e9senter fid\u00e8lement un bout d'histoire de la plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bre des courses d\u2019endurance. Chacune d\u2019entre elles a une vraie histoire avec les 24H du Mans, qu\u2019elle ait r\u00e9ellement concouru ou qu\u2019elle ait servi pour des essais. En clair, vous ne verrez aucune r\u00e9plique !\r\n \r\nSur notre circuit, vous pourrez d\u00e9couvrir entre autres: \r\n\r\nLa Ford GT40P de 1966. LA Ford comme dans le film \"Le Mans 66\" ! Celle d\u2019Autoworld a \u00e9t\u00e9 utilis\u00e9e pour les essais de la fameuse course au cours de laquelle Ford a d\u00e9tr\u00f4n\u00e9 Ferrari en s'emparant des 3 premi\u00e8res places! Elle \u00e9tait m\u00eame la voiture r\u00e9serve pour la comp\u00e9tition.\r\n\r\nLa Inalt\u00e9ra (1976). Ce nom ne vous dit rien? Il s'agit du premier bolide \u00e0 se pr\u00e9senter sous le nom de son sponsor! Elle est \u00e9galement la premi\u00e8re voiture con\u00e7ue et d\u00e9velopp\u00e9e par Jean Rondeau (pilote et constructeur automobile fran\u00e7ais qui f\u00fbt le seul \u00e0 remporter les 24H du Mans au volant de sa propre cr\u00e9ation). C\u2019est \u00e9galement \u00e0 bord de cette Inalt\u00e9ra que Christine, une de nos femmes pilotes belges et Lella Lombardi remport\u00e8rent la \u00ab Coupe des Dames \u00bb en 1977.\r\n\r\nLa Peugeot 905. Cette derni\u00e8re a fait un doubl\u00e9 en 1992 en remportant les 24H du Mans et le Championnat du monde. ll faut dire qu'elle pr\u00e9sente un atout dans sa conception qui a certainement favoris\u00e9 ses victoires: son ch\u00e2ssis a b\u00e9n\u00e9fici\u00e9 de la technologie de Dassault Aviation et son moteur est proche de ce qui se faisait en Formule 1 \u00e0 l'\u00e9poque.\r\n\r\n\r\nCertes, les belles sont au c\u0153ur de l\u2019expo mais la mise en sc\u00e8ne n\u2019est pas en reste : tous les d\u00e9tails du circuit y sont reproduits: du bruit des moteurs, \u00e0 la place des voitures sur la grille de d\u00e9part aux \u00e9changes avec les pilotes. Des petits films retra\u00e7ant l'histoire et les plus beaux moments des courses termineront de vous faire voyager dans l'espace et dans le temps.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"nl":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":"Ik ben een mythisch circuit voor alle motorsport fans. Ik vier dit jaar mijn honderdste verjaardag. Wie ben ik? Het Circuit van Le Mans, natuurlijk!\r\nTer ere van dit niet te missen jubileum en als opwarmertje presenteert Autoworld de tentoonstelling \"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history\", van 1 april tot en met 28 mei 2023.","longdescr":"De tentoongestelde auto's zijn zorgvuldig geselecteerd om een stukje geschiedenis van de beroemdste uithoudingsrace getrouw weer te geven. Elk van hen heeft een echte geschiedenis met de 24 uur van Le Mans, of hij nu daadwerkelijk heeft deelgenomen of is gebruikt om te testen. Kortom, u zult geen replica's zien!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"en":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":"I\u2019m a mythical circuit for all motorsport aficionados. I\u2018m celebrating my centenary this year. Who am I? The Circuit of Le Mans, of course!\r\nTo pay tribute to this unforgettable anniversary and as a warm-up, Autoworld presents its \u201c24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history\u201d exhibition, from the 1st April up to and including 28thMay.","longdescr":"The cars displayed have been selected with care to faithfully represent a piece of history of the most renowned endurance race. Each one these boasts a true history with the 24 Hours of Le Mans, whether it actually competed or was used as a practice machine. In other words, you will not come across any replicas!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"de":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"it":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"sp":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"pt":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"},"cn":{"name":"24H of Le Mans, 100 years of race history","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","email":"info@autoworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555048"}},"place":{"id":734,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld est un lieu exceptionnel et unique tant par son architecture que par la collection qu\u2019il abrite et les expositions qui y sont organis\u00e9es.\r\nLe mus\u00e9e est situ\u00e9 dans un prestigieux \u00e9difice du Parc du Cinquantenaire, construit en 1880 pour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer le 50\u00e8me anniversaire de la cr\u00e9ation du Royaume de Belgique. \r\n\r\nPlus de 300 v\u00e9hicules, carrosses et motos de diff\u00e9rentes origines retracent l\u2019histoire de l\u2019automobile et illustrent le d\u00e9veloppement spectaculaire des v\u00e9hicules sur plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle. Les voitures les plus embl\u00e9matiques de chaque \u00e9poque permettent \u00e9galement de suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution du design automobile du d\u00e9but jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui.  \r\nDes zones \u00e0 th\u00e8mes mettent en lumi\u00e8re des aspects sp\u00e9cifiques de cette histoire. La zone \u00ab Sport & Comp\u00e9tition \u00bb retrace les grandes \u00e9tapes de la comp\u00e9tition automobile (rallyes et courses) depuis 1906, et la zone \u00ab Belgium at Autoworld \u00bb rappelle que notre pays fut l\u2019un des principaux fabricants automobiles au d\u00e9but du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Dans la nouvelle \u00ab Media room \u00bb des films, vid\u00e9os et documents historiques relatent eux aussi cette histoire ainsi que l\u2019\u00e9volution automobile depuis les 30 derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es.\r\nDes expositions temporaires sont r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement organis\u00e9es.\r\nPlus d\u2019infos et le calendrier des expositions sur : www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 11","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Autoworld, het nationale automuseum, is gelegen in het hart van Brussel, ondergebracht in een prestigieus gebouw in het Jubelpark. \r\n\r\nMeer dan 300 voertuigen (auto's, vrachtwagens en motorfietsen) worden er permanent tentoongesteld.  De bezoeker wordt er langs de fabelachtige geschiedenis van de auto van 1896 tot nu geleid, vanaf de oudste modellen uit een ver verleden tot hedendaagse auto's die ons een blik gunnen op  de voertuigen van morgen en zelfs van later. \r\nDe collectie werd onlangs aangevuld met een groot aantal voertuigen uit de spannendste jaren van de autogeschiedenis sinds 1960. In een licht en luchtig decor kan het publiek de tentoongestelde auto's van dichtbij bewonderen. \r\nHier en daar werden themazones ingericht, waar voertuigen van de openbare diensten, auto's die ooit aan de Koninklijke Familie toebehoorden, microcars en modellen onder het thema Design Story en Sport & Competition worden tentoongesteld.\r\nCentraal in het museum bevindt zich 'Belgium at Autoworld', een ruimte die volledig aan de bakermat en de geschiedenis van de Belgische auto-industrie tot op de dag van vandaag gewijd is. \r\nIn de 'Sport & Competition'-zone wordt een overzicht gegeven van de grote perioden in de geschiedenis van de autosport (rally en circuit) sinds 1906. \r\nAutoworld is een museum dat voortdurend evolueert. Het hele jaar door worden er tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd over verschillende thema's die verband houden met de auto.\r\nMeer informatie over de kalender van de tentoonstellingen vindt u op www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An impressive historic building in Brussels, linked with automotive history, is home to Autoworld, the Belgian National Automobile Museum. Situated in the \u2018Parc du Cinquantenaire\u2019, the neo-classical building commemorated the 50th anniversary of the Kingdom of Belgium in 1880. From 1902 to 1936 it hosted motor\u00accar and motorbike exhibitions. Since 1986 it has treasured the major part of Ghislain Mahy\u2019s renowned classic car collection. \r\n\r\nOver 300 vehicles, ranging from cars and trucks to motorcycles, are on permanent display. From the earliest models of the dis\u00actant past to contemporary cars that prefigure the automobile of tomorrow, visitors are guided through the motorcar\u2019s history dating as far back as 1896. \r\n\r\nVarious cars representing the most exciting years of the auto\u00acmobile history since 1960 can be approached and admired from close by, thanks to a brilliantly designed scenography.\r\nSpecial sections focus on sports and competition, cars owned by the Belgian Royal Family, micro and bubble cars, and car design. The Belgium at Autoworld section is dedicated to the roots and history of the Belgian car industry. \r\n\r\nAutoworld is a museum on the move, with temporary exhibi\u00actions taking on various automotive themes organised through\u00acout the year. \r\n\r\nMore detailed information on autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld ist ein au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Ort, einzigartig in seiner Architektur, seiner Sammlung und den dort organisierten Ausstellungen.\r\nDas Museum befindet sich in einem repr\u00e4sentativen Geb\u00e4ude des Parc du Cinquantenaire, welches  1880 anl\u00e4sslich des 50. Jahrestages der Gr\u00fcndung des K\u00f6nigreichs Belgien erbaut wurde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 300 Fahrzeuge, Reisebusse und Motorr\u00e4der unterschiedlicher Herkunft zeichnen die Geschichte des Automobils nach und veranschaulichen die spektakul\u00e4re Entwicklung von Fahrzeugen \u00fcber mehr als ein Jahrhundert. Die emblematischsten Autos jeder Epoche erm\u00f6glichen es au\u00dferdem, die Entwicklung des Autodesigns von Anfang an bis heute zu verfolgen.\r\nThemenbereiche beleuchten spezifische Aspekte dieser Geschichte. Der \u201eSport & Wettbewerb\u201c Abschnitt zeichnet die Meilensteine des Motorsport (Rallyes und Rennen) seit 1906. \r\n\u201eMan darf nicht vergessen, dass unser Land im fr\u00fchen 20. Jahrhundert eines der wichtigsten Automobilhersteller war\u201c.\r\nIm neuen \"Media Room\" erz\u00e4hlen Filme, Videos und historische Dokumente diese Geschichte ebenso wie die automobile Entwicklung der letzten 30 Jahre.\r\n\r\nTempor\u00e4re Ausstellungen werden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig organisiert.\r\n\r\nWeitere Informationen und den Messekalender finden Sie unter: www.autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, la collezione d'auto pi\u00f9 prestigiosa al mondo, inaugurata nel 1986 \u00e8 ospitata nel sontuoso edificio del Palais Mondial di Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 pi\u00f9 di unmuseo, vi scoprirete una collezione di pi\u00f9 di 250 auto che raccontano la storia dell'automobile  dalle sue origini. Una zona interamente allestitata con la scenografia delle gare di auto , un altra zona dove si racconta il la storia dell'automobile e del Belgio. Il tutto situato nel Parco  Halle Sud del Cinquantenario a Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld, un museo vivente\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 un museo vivente dove vi attende la nuova sezione Sport & Comp\u00e9tition che traccia le grandi tappe della competizione automobilistica in una scenografia originale e dinamica. \r\nSenza dimenticare la sezione pedagogica che rappresenta in maniera interattiva e ludica i vari aspetti del settore automobilistico. \r\nIl museo propone delle esposizioni dedicate al mondo dell'automobile, ai personaggi chiave della sua storia e all'evoluzione della mobilit\u00e0. \r\n\r\nSe le auto da corsa vi appassionano non perdete il laboratorio di restauroche ha luogo ogni domenica.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A menudo olvidamos que el autom\u00f3vil fue uno de los florones de la industria belga antes de la Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germanin y Vivinus, por citar solo los m\u00e1s importantes. La estructura met\u00e1lica fue dise\u00f1ada en 1880. Acogi\u00f3 el sal\u00f3n del autom\u00f3vil de 1902 a 1934. El museo puede ser considerado como uno de los m\u00e1s prestigiosos de su g\u00e9nero en Europa, incluso del mundo (aproximadamente 400 veh\u00edculos, todos en estado de funcionamiento). Podemos revivir la historia del autom\u00f3vil desde el a\u00f1o 1886 hasta los a\u00f1os 70, desde el Ford T hasta llegar al Citro\u00ebn 2CV, el Volkswagen Escarabajo, el Tatra checo y algunos modelos raros que han pertenecido a celebridades de nuestro siglo (a la familia real belga o tambi\u00e9n un veh\u00edculo especialmente dise\u00f1ado seg\u00fan las exigencias del Sha de Persia, pero jam\u00e1s entregado)","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esquecemo-nos frequentemente que o autom\u00f3vel foi um dos baluartes da ind\u00fastria belga antes da Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germain, Vivinus, para citar alguns dos mais importantes. A estrutura met\u00e1lica do museu foi concebida em 1880. Abrigou o Sal\u00e3o Autom\u00f3vel de 1902 a 1934. O museu pode ser considerado como um dos mais prestigiosos do seu g\u00e9nero na Europa, ou mesmo no mundo (cerca de 400 ve\u00edculos, todos operacionais). Podemos a\u00ed reviver a hist\u00f3ria do autom\u00f3vel, de 1886 aos anos 70, da Ford T, passando pela 2CV da Citro\u00ebn, a Carocha alem\u00e3, a Tatra checoslovaca e alguns modelos raros que pertenceram a celebridades do nosso s\u00e9culo (\u00e0 fam\u00edlia real belga ou um ve\u00edculo especialmente concebido de acordo com as exig\u00eancias do X\u00e1 da P\u00e9rsia, mas nunca fornecido).\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"],"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"],"de":["Osten"],"it":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":147,"location":{"lat":50.83992036,"lon":4.39340998},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-25T02:37:39+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":734,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld est un lieu exceptionnel et unique tant par son architecture que par la collection qu\u2019il abrite et les expositions qui y sont organis\u00e9es.\r\nLe mus\u00e9e est situ\u00e9 dans un prestigieux \u00e9difice du Parc du Cinquantenaire, construit en 1880 pour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer le 50\u00e8me anniversaire de la cr\u00e9ation du Royaume de Belgique. \r\n\r\nPlus de 300 v\u00e9hicules, carrosses et motos de diff\u00e9rentes origines retracent l\u2019histoire de l\u2019automobile et illustrent le d\u00e9veloppement spectaculaire des v\u00e9hicules sur plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle. Les voitures les plus embl\u00e9matiques de chaque \u00e9poque permettent \u00e9galement de suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution du design automobile du d\u00e9but jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui.  \r\nDes zones \u00e0 th\u00e8mes mettent en lumi\u00e8re des aspects sp\u00e9cifiques de cette histoire. La zone \u00ab Sport & Comp\u00e9tition \u00bb retrace les grandes \u00e9tapes de la comp\u00e9tition automobile (rallyes et courses) depuis 1906, et la zone \u00ab Belgium at Autoworld \u00bb rappelle que notre pays fut l\u2019un des principaux fabricants automobiles au d\u00e9but du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Dans la nouvelle \u00ab Media room \u00bb des films, vid\u00e9os et documents historiques relatent eux aussi cette histoire ainsi que l\u2019\u00e9volution automobile depuis les 30 derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es.\r\nDes expositions temporaires sont r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement organis\u00e9es.\r\nPlus d\u2019infos et le calendrier des expositions sur : www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 11","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Autoworld, het nationale automuseum, is gelegen in het hart van Brussel, ondergebracht in een prestigieus gebouw in het Jubelpark. \r\n\r\nMeer dan 300 voertuigen (auto's, vrachtwagens en motorfietsen) worden er permanent tentoongesteld.  De bezoeker wordt er langs de fabelachtige geschiedenis van de auto van 1896 tot nu geleid, vanaf de oudste modellen uit een ver verleden tot hedendaagse auto's die ons een blik gunnen op  de voertuigen van morgen en zelfs van later. \r\nDe collectie werd onlangs aangevuld met een groot aantal voertuigen uit de spannendste jaren van de autogeschiedenis sinds 1960. In een licht en luchtig decor kan het publiek de tentoongestelde auto's van dichtbij bewonderen. \r\nHier en daar werden themazones ingericht, waar voertuigen van de openbare diensten, auto's die ooit aan de Koninklijke Familie toebehoorden, microcars en modellen onder het thema Design Story en Sport & Competition worden tentoongesteld.\r\nCentraal in het museum bevindt zich 'Belgium at Autoworld', een ruimte die volledig aan de bakermat en de geschiedenis van de Belgische auto-industrie tot op de dag van vandaag gewijd is. \r\nIn de 'Sport & Competition'-zone wordt een overzicht gegeven van de grote perioden in de geschiedenis van de autosport (rally en circuit) sinds 1906. \r\nAutoworld is een museum dat voortdurend evolueert. Het hele jaar door worden er tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd over verschillende thema's die verband houden met de auto.\r\nMeer informatie over de kalender van de tentoonstellingen vindt u op www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An impressive historic building in Brussels, linked with automotive history, is home to Autoworld, the Belgian National Automobile Museum. Situated in the \u2018Parc du Cinquantenaire\u2019, the neo-classical building commemorated the 50th anniversary of the Kingdom of Belgium in 1880. From 1902 to 1936 it hosted motor\u00accar and motorbike exhibitions. Since 1986 it has treasured the major part of Ghislain Mahy\u2019s renowned classic car collection. \r\n\r\nOver 300 vehicles, ranging from cars and trucks to motorcycles, are on permanent display. From the earliest models of the dis\u00actant past to contemporary cars that prefigure the automobile of tomorrow, visitors are guided through the motorcar\u2019s history dating as far back as 1896. \r\n\r\nVarious cars representing the most exciting years of the auto\u00acmobile history since 1960 can be approached and admired from close by, thanks to a brilliantly designed scenography.\r\nSpecial sections focus on sports and competition, cars owned by the Belgian Royal Family, micro and bubble cars, and car design. The Belgium at Autoworld section is dedicated to the roots and history of the Belgian car industry. \r\n\r\nAutoworld is a museum on the move, with temporary exhibi\u00actions taking on various automotive themes organised through\u00acout the year. \r\n\r\nMore detailed information on autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld ist ein au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Ort, einzigartig in seiner Architektur, seiner Sammlung und den dort organisierten Ausstellungen.\r\nDas Museum befindet sich in einem repr\u00e4sentativen Geb\u00e4ude des Parc du Cinquantenaire, welches  1880 anl\u00e4sslich des 50. Jahrestages der Gr\u00fcndung des K\u00f6nigreichs Belgien erbaut wurde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 300 Fahrzeuge, Reisebusse und Motorr\u00e4der unterschiedlicher Herkunft zeichnen die Geschichte des Automobils nach und veranschaulichen die spektakul\u00e4re Entwicklung von Fahrzeugen \u00fcber mehr als ein Jahrhundert. Die emblematischsten Autos jeder Epoche erm\u00f6glichen es au\u00dferdem, die Entwicklung des Autodesigns von Anfang an bis heute zu verfolgen.\r\nThemenbereiche beleuchten spezifische Aspekte dieser Geschichte. Der \u201eSport & Wettbewerb\u201c Abschnitt zeichnet die Meilensteine des Motorsport (Rallyes und Rennen) seit 1906. \r\n\u201eMan darf nicht vergessen, dass unser Land im fr\u00fchen 20. Jahrhundert eines der wichtigsten Automobilhersteller war\u201c.\r\nIm neuen \"Media Room\" erz\u00e4hlen Filme, Videos und historische Dokumente diese Geschichte ebenso wie die automobile Entwicklung der letzten 30 Jahre.\r\n\r\nTempor\u00e4re Ausstellungen werden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig organisiert.\r\n\r\nWeitere Informationen und den Messekalender finden Sie unter: www.autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, la collezione d'auto pi\u00f9 prestigiosa al mondo, inaugurata nel 1986 \u00e8 ospitata nel sontuoso edificio del Palais Mondial di Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 pi\u00f9 di unmuseo, vi scoprirete una collezione di pi\u00f9 di 250 auto che raccontano la storia dell'automobile  dalle sue origini. Una zona interamente allestitata con la scenografia delle gare di auto , un altra zona dove si racconta il la storia dell'automobile e del Belgio. Il tutto situato nel Parco  Halle Sud del Cinquantenario a Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld, un museo vivente\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 un museo vivente dove vi attende la nuova sezione Sport & Comp\u00e9tition che traccia le grandi tappe della competizione automobilistica in una scenografia originale e dinamica. \r\nSenza dimenticare la sezione pedagogica che rappresenta in maniera interattiva e ludica i vari aspetti del settore automobilistico. \r\nIl museo propone delle esposizioni dedicate al mondo dell'automobile, ai personaggi chiave della sua storia e all'evoluzione della mobilit\u00e0. \r\n\r\nSe le auto da corsa vi appassionano non perdete il laboratorio di restauroche ha luogo ogni domenica.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A menudo olvidamos que el autom\u00f3vil fue uno de los florones de la industria belga antes de la Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germanin y Vivinus, por citar solo los m\u00e1s importantes. La estructura met\u00e1lica fue dise\u00f1ada en 1880. Acogi\u00f3 el sal\u00f3n del autom\u00f3vil de 1902 a 1934. El museo puede ser considerado como uno de los m\u00e1s prestigiosos de su g\u00e9nero en Europa, incluso del mundo (aproximadamente 400 veh\u00edculos, todos en estado de funcionamiento). Podemos revivir la historia del autom\u00f3vil desde el a\u00f1o 1886 hasta los a\u00f1os 70, desde el Ford T hasta llegar al Citro\u00ebn 2CV, el Volkswagen Escarabajo, el Tatra checo y algunos modelos raros que han pertenecido a celebridades de nuestro siglo (a la familia real belga o tambi\u00e9n un veh\u00edculo especialmente dise\u00f1ado seg\u00fan las exigencias del Sha de Persia, pero jam\u00e1s entregado)","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esquecemo-nos frequentemente que o autom\u00f3vel foi um dos baluartes da ind\u00fastria belga antes da Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germain, Vivinus, para citar alguns dos mais importantes. A estrutura met\u00e1lica do museu foi concebida em 1880. Abrigou o Sal\u00e3o Autom\u00f3vel de 1902 a 1934. O museu pode ser considerado como um dos mais prestigiosos do seu g\u00e9nero na Europa, ou mesmo no mundo (cerca de 400 ve\u00edculos, todos operacionais). Podemos a\u00ed reviver a hist\u00f3ria do autom\u00f3vel, de 1886 aos anos 70, da Ford T, passando pela 2CV da Citro\u00ebn, a Carocha alem\u00e3, a Tatra checoslovaca e alguns modelos raros que pertenceram a celebridades do nosso s\u00e9culo (\u00e0 fam\u00edlia real belga ou um ve\u00edculo especialmente concebido de acordo com as exig\u00eancias do X\u00e1 da P\u00e9rsia, mas nunca fornecido).\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":147,"location":{"lat":50.83992036,"lon":4.39340998},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-25T02:37:39+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"video","link":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/812320851","oEmbed_type":"video","oEmbed_version":"1.0","oEmbed_provider_name":"Vimeo","oEmbed_provider_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/","oEmbed_title":"24 Heures du Mans 2023 - Teaser officiel Centenaire (720p).mp4","oEmbed_author_name":"Autoworld Brussels","oEmbed_author_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/user16340967","oEmbed_is_plus":"0","oEmbed_account_type":"business","oEmbed_html":"<iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/812320851?h=4097a4a7d4&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen title=\"24 Heures du Mans 2023 - Teaser officiel Centenaire (720p).mp4\"><\/iframe>","oEmbed_width":700,"oEmbed_height":394,"oEmbed_duration":