cratchy and distorted, sometimes joyfully floating, their songs are for everyone who loves to let some energetic and guitar-loaded music into their ears!\r\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/1PGFrlFMjm2RI-\r\ni2ndQ0lHG?si=4CZnnS7wRvanHbMqUWjGYg\r\nBandcamp:\r\nhttps:\/\/batbait.bandcamp.com\/\r\n--- --- ---\r\n***Solar Corona (PT) Psych Kraut Rock***\r\nThe motoric return of Solar Corona turns minimal rock into an expansive, ever-churning psychedelic voyage in their newest offering, PACE. The band's fifth release, PACE, shifts gears with Lorr No (Nuno Loureiro) hitching a ride as a dubmechanic that pulls the progressive stonerism of Solar Corona's core trio\u2014Rodrigo Carvalho (Guitar\/synths), Peter Carvalho (drums), Jos\u00e9 Roberto Gomes (bass)\u2014into an off-road expanse. The album takes its listener on an ambitious journey, through stripped-down songwriting that reaches a new power through its simplicity. . For fans of the expansive rock music of acts like Endless Boogie, Circle, Pharaoh Overlord, Hawkwind, and GNOD.\r\nhttps:\/\/solarcorona.bandcamp.com\/album\/pace-2\r\n--- --- ---\r\nA partir de 19:30h \/\/ 9 Euros (Nobody gets turned away for lack of funds)\r\n\u2028Please bring CASH!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551255"},"nl":{"name":"BATBAIT (CH) + Solar Corona (PT)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551255"},"en":{"name":"BATBAIT (CH) + Solar Corona (PT)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visit