entique et l\u2019image num\u00e9rique, deux \u00e9pisodes d\u2019une fable sur la m\u00e9moire qui prend l\u2019image pour objet central.","longdescr":"\"Rep\u00e9rer la mati\u00e8re premi\u00e8re derri\u00e8re la repr\u00e9sentation, c\u2019est non seulement envisager nos images dans le lointain \u00e9cho d\u2019une \u00e9conomie mais aussi questionner la fa\u00e7on dont le regard circule \u00e0 la surface de ces mat\u00e9rialit\u00e9s.\"  Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","performers":"Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"nl":{"name":"Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent - 'Defected Times'","shortdescr":"Defected Times is de eerste tentoonstelling van Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent in Belgi\u00eb. Ze presenteert twee reeksen werken, gebaseerd op twee parallelle verhalen over de analoge fotografie en het digitale beeld, twee episodes in een fabel over het geheugen waarin het beeld centraal staat.","longdescr":"\"De grondstof opsporen waaruit een afbeelding is samengesteld impliceert niet alleen dat we onze beeldvorming beschouwen in de verre echo van een economie, maar ook de manier in vraag stellen waarmee onze blik dwaalt over het oppervlak van deze materialiteiten.\" Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","performers":"Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"en":{"name":"Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent - 'Defected Times'","shortdescr":"Defected Times is Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent\u2019s first exhibition in Belgium. It presents two sets of works, based on two parallel narratives on traditional film photography and the digital image, two episodes in a fable about memory that has image as its central focus.","longdescr":"\"Identifying the raw material that lies behind the representation is not only a way of\r\nconsidering our images against the distant echo of an economic context but also of\r\nquestioning how the gaze travels over the surface of these material forms.\" Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","performers":"Daphn\u00e9 Le Sergent","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"de":{"name":"Defected Times","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"it":{"name":"Defected Times","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"sp":{"name":"Defected Times","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"pt":{"name":"Defected Times","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"},"cn":{"name":"Defected Times","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","email":"info@contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.552740"}},"place":{"id":10229,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Contretype","address_street_name":"Cit\u00e9 Fontainas","address_street_number":"4 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contretype@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9 Fontainas, 4 A","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Association fond\u00e9e en 1978 par Jean-Louis Godefroid (1952-2013), Contretype se pr\u00e9sente comme un espace d\u2019exposition, de production et de diffusion centr\u00e9 sur la photographie cr\u00e9ative, sans consid\u00e9ration de pratiques ou de genres particuliers. Depuis plus de trente ans, Contretype \u0153uvre \u00e0 l\u2019accueil \u00e0 Bruxelles de productions europ\u00e9ennes et extra europ\u00e9ennes et, en instaurant des relations de travail avec ses partenaires, diffuse la production d\u2019artistes belges \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger. Les principales activit\u00e9s de Contretype sont les suivantes: expositions \u00e0 la Cit\u00e9 Fontainas ou hors les murs, cr\u00e9ation de missions photographiques, r\u00e9sidences d\u2019artistes, \u00e9dition de livres photographiques et de porte-folios et organisation de conf\u00e9rences \u00e0 propos de la photographie.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CONTRETYPE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Contretype","address_street_name":"Fontainashof","address_street_number":"4 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contretype@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Fontainashof, 4 A","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Contretype werd in 1978 opgericht door Jean-Louis Godefroid (1952-2013) en profileert zich als een ruimte voor expositie, productie en verspreiding, specifiek gericht op de creatieve fotografie die geen rekening houdt met specifieke genres of praktijken. Al meer dan dertig jaar ijvert Contretype ervoor om in Brussel zowel Europese als niet-Europese producties binnen te halen. En via goede werkrelaties met zijn partners slaagt Contretype er ook in om producties van Belgische artiesten te verspreiden in het buitenland. De belangrijkste activiteiten van Contretype zijn: exposities in het Fontainashof of extra muros, creatie van fotomissies, artiestenresidenties, uitgave van fotoboeken en -portfolio\u2019s, en de organisatie van conferenties over fotografie.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CONTRETYPE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Contretype","address_street_name":"Cit\u00e9 Fontainas","address_street_number":"4 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contretype@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.contretype.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 42 20","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9 Fontainas, 4 A","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Contretype is an association that was founded in 1978 by Jean-Louis Godefroid (1952-2013). It describes itself as an exhibition, production and distribution space focusing on creative photography irrespective of particular practices or genres. For more than thirty years, Contretype has been engaged in catering for European and extra-European artistic output in Brussels and, by establishing working relationships with its partners, distributing the output of Belgian artists abroad. The main activities of Contretype are : exhibitions in Cit\u00e9 Fontainas or, externally, setting up photographic missions, artists\u2019 residencies, publishing photography books and portfolios and holding conferences on photography. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CONTRETYPE","virtual_visit"