e l\u2019Asie mineure et les complaintes populaires de rebetiko.","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s avoir bien mang\u00e9 et bien bu, on se laissera emporter par des histoires de voyages et de r\u00eaves cont\u00e9es par Adrien Lociuro. \r\n\r\nEnsuite, on laissera notre esprit divaguer, nos jambes se d\u00e9gourdir sur la musique du trio compos\u00e9 par Asimina Karamperopoulou (voix), Renaud Dardenne (guitare) et Antonios Moutselos (violon). \r\n\r\nDe 18h30 \u00e0 23h au MedexMuseum (rue Longue-vie 34A) \r\nEntr\u00e9e \u00e0 prix libre et conscient (Pay What You Can) \r\n\r\nPlus d'infos sur la page de l'\u00e9v\u00e8nement : https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/LBuYVzCq\r\n\r\nCet \u00e9v\u00e8nement est organis\u00e9 dans le cadre du projet multiculturel et culinaire \"Le Tour du Monde en 183 assiettes\". \r\n\r\nPour en savoir plus, visite notre site web : http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","performers":"Asimina Karamperopoulou (voix) ; Renaud Dardenne (guitare) ; Antonios Moutselos (violon)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554418"},"nl":{"name":"Conte et concert : balade sonore dans les \u00eeles grecques @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"After having eaten and drunk well, we will be carried away by stories of travel and dreams told by Adrien Lociuro. \r\n\r\nThen we'll let our minds wander and our legs stretch to the music of the trio composed of Asimina Karamperopoulou (voice), Renaud Dardenne (guitar) and Antonios Moutselos (violin). \r\n\r\nFrom 6.30 pm to 11 pm at MedexMuseum (rue Longue-vie 34A) \r\nPay What You Can (not just what you want) >> free and fair price \r\n\r\nMore info on the event page: https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/LBuYVzCq\r\n\r\nThis event is organised in the framework of the multicultural and culinary project \"Around the world in 183 plates\". \r\nFor more information, visit our website: http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554418"},"en":{"name":"Conte et concert : balade sonore dans les \u00eeles grecques @MedexMuseum","shortdescr":"Sound stopover in the Greek islands. The Ephemeral Museum of Exile invites you to a concert mixing island songs and traditional music from the horizons of Asia Minor.","longdescr":"After having eaten and drunk well, we will be carried away by stories of travel and dreams told by Adrien Lociuro. \r\n\r\nThen we'll let our minds wander and our legs stretch to the music of the trio composed of Asimina Karamperopoulou (voice), Renaud Dardenne (guitar) and Antonios Moutselos (violin). \r\n\r\nFrom 6.30 pm to 11 pm at MedexMuseum (rue Longue-vie 34A) \r\nPay What You Can (not just what you want) >> free and fair price \r\n\r\nMore info on the event page: https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/LBuYVzCq\r\n\r\nThis event is organised in the framework of the multicultural and culinary project \"Around the world in 183 plates\". \r\nFor more information, visit our website: http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554418"},"de":{"name":"Concert : balade sonore dans les \u00eeles grecques","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.medexmuseum.com\/183-assiettes\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554418"},"it":{"name":"Concert : balade sonore dans les