uvres expos\u00e9es.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"The Palm Beach","address_street_name":"Meyerbeerstraat","address_street_number":"61","address_street_box":null,"email":"sandrineviumasia@me.com","website":"http:\/\/www.thepalmbeach.be","phone_contact":"+32 474 86 42 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Meyerbeerstraat, 61","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"The Palm Beach is een atypische galerie gevestigd in een art deco huis van Joseph Diongre, de ontwerper van het Flageygebouw. Sandrine Viu Masia, curator van de galerie, zoekt  jong talent en stelt hen voor in kwalitatieve, niet-alledaagse tentoonstellingen. Er wordt bijzondere aandacht besteed aan de ontvangst van het publiek en aan de duiding van de symbiose tussen de plaats en de tentoongestelde werken. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"The Palm Beach","address_street_name":"Rue Meyerbeer","address_street_number":"61","address_street_box":null,"email":"sandrineviumasia@me.com","website":"http:\/\/www.thepalmbeach.be","phone_contact":"+32 474 86 42 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Rue Meyerbeer, 61","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"The Palm Beach is an atypical gallery located in an Art Deco house designed by Joseph Diongre, the architect of the Flagey building. Sandrine Viu Masia, the curator of the place, enjoys discovering young talented artists and introducing them to the public in quality exhibitions. Particular attention is paid to welcoming the audience and making them aware of the symbiosis between the setting and the exhibited works.","description_print":"The Palm Beach or a new way to meet new Artists!","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"The Palm Beach","address_street_name":"Rue Meyerbeer","addre