un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re T