["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-18T12:35:06+02:00","published_at":"2023-04-18T10:39:56+02:00","backoffice_id":275597,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.5},{"id":553993,"date_start":"2023-04-01","date_end":"2023-05-14","date_next":"2023-04-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,38],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Sculpture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Beeldhouwkunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Sculpture"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Skulptur"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Scultura"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Escultura"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin\r\nSur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux, les influenceuses et les influenceurs vendent la d\u00e9mesure de produits inutiles, la futilit\u00e9 comme l\u2019Omega du sur-mesure. Perdu dans cet oc\u00e9an de d\u00e9chets, accroch\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9pave de ce qui fut notre intimit\u00e9, nous attendons, promesse de ces nouveaux messies, d\u2019\u00eatre secouru par un yacht de luxe. Nous avons d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de croire dans les superlatifs de notre modernit\u00e9, mais la seule chose qui nous revient sont ceux des superlatifs climatiques, des bombes sociales ou de la guerre. L\u2019exposition MIJN TUIN_mon jardin d\u00e9ploie les dessins et les sculptures de quatre artistes singulier.es qui arpentent, chacun\u00b7e \u00e0 leur \u00e9chelle, la d\u00e9mesure de notre environnement.","performers":"Vincent Anaskeviez, Lilian Bourgeat, Laurent Martin","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"nl":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin\r\nOp sociale netwerken verkopen influencers een overdaad aan overbodige producten, overbodigheid als de omega van het maatwerk. Verloren in deze oceaan van afval, ons vastklampend aan het wrak dat ooit onze intimiteit was, wachten we, beloofd door deze nieuwe messiassen, om gered te worden door een luxejacht. We hebben besloten te geloven in de superlatieven van onze moderniteit, maar het enige dat ons terugkomt zijn de superlatieven van het klimaat, de sociale bommen of de oorlog. De tentoonstelling MIJN TUIN_mon jardin toont de tekeningen en sculpturen van drie bijzondere kunstenaars die, elk op hun eigen schaal, de overdaad van onze omgeving onderzoeken.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"en":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"MIJN TUIN_my garden\r\nMarch 2023 ELEVEN STEENS\r\nOn social networks, influencers sell the excess of useless products, the futility like the Omega of tailor-made. Lost in this ocean of waste, clinging to the wreckage of what used to be our intimacy, we wait, promise of these new messiahs, to be rescued by a luxury yacht. We have decided to believe in the superlatives of our modernity, but the only thing that comes back to us are those of climatic superlatives, social bombs or war. The MIJN TUIN_my garden exhibition deploys the drawings and sculptures of four singular artists who survey, each on their own scale, the excess of our environment.\r\nLilian BOURGEAT, Laurent MARTIN, Vincent ANASKIEVIEZ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"de":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"it":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"sp":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"pt":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"},"cn":{"name":"MIJN TUIN_mon jardin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","email":"contact@elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553993"}},"place":{"id":275965,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Eleven Steens","address_street_name":"Rue Steens","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"jm.dimanche@elevensteens.com","website":"http:\/\/elevensteens.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Steens, 11","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Ouvert au printemps 2019, ELEVEN STEENS est un espace consacr\u00e9 \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine, et ce de mani\u00e8re totalement transversale, puisque s\u2019int\u00e9ressant aussi bien \u00e0 l\u2019art, au design, aux m\u00e9tiers d\u2019art, \u00e0 la mode, \u00e0 l\u2019architecture\u2026 ou encore aux arts vivants.\r\n\r\nLieu d\u2019exploration et de production, il invite en priorit\u00e9 la jeune cr\u00e9ation \u00e0 s\u2019exprimer autour de la mati\u00e8re, \u00e0 travers expositions, installations, performances, conf\u00e9rences, workshops\u2026 Il se veut un lieu alternatif, une plateforme unique et ind\u00e9pendante qui propose de faire se rencontrer jeunes artistes, designers ou artisans avec le public local de Saint-Gilles, mais aussi bien s\u00fbr les bruxellois, et plus largement un r\u00e9seau de collectionneurs internationaux.\r\n\r\nLa mati\u00e8re constitue une sorte de fil rouge, ou plut\u00f4t les mati\u00e8res qui seront au c\u0153ur de chaque nouvelle invitation, avec pour finalit\u00e9 expositions th\u00e9matiques ou \u00e9v\u00e9nements performants.\r\nAu c\u0153ur du dispositif, la collection du propri\u00e9taire et initiateur du lieu pourra inspirer la programmation, ou bien venir simplement dialoguer au fil des expositions invit\u00e9es. Un \u00e9tage privil\u00e9gi\u00e9 lui sera consacr\u00e9, trait\u00e9 de mani\u00e8re plus intime, et r\u00e9serv\u00e9 \u00e0 la visite priv\u00e9e.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Eleven Steens","address_street_name":"Steensstraat","address_street_number":"11