65],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-23T02:38:53+02:00","published_at":"2022-02-02T09:34:16+01:00","backoffice_id":246596,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"brocante","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.12508148633338},{"id":539560,"date_start":"2022-08-11","date_end":"2024-01-06","date_next":"2023-04-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","es"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"nl":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com\/activity\/chocolate-beer-and-fries-tour-of-brussels\/","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"en":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":"Live a truly gourmet experience during our chocolate, beer and fries tasting tour of Brussels.\r\n\r\nIt includes a tasting of six chocolates, four beers and fries in just three hours.","longdescr":"On our chocolate, beer and fries tasting chocolate tour of Brussels, we start with a tasting of six pralines, made by authentic Belgian master chocolatiers such as Pierre Marcolini and Mery\u2019s. Also, from the new generation of Chocolatiers like master chocolatier Jitsk, who has been researching further and has come up with new fusions of different flavours and smells. We will be delighted in tasting a unique fusion of flavours: mango with yuzu, cassis with black pepper, coffee with coconut spices, lime kefir with potato vodka, curry with raisins and salted macadamia, \u2026 All these blends covered with dark chocolate, a higher temptation. Yeah, Brussels doesn\u2019t just smell like chocolate, it tastes like chocolate.\r\n\r\nAfter finishing the chocolate tasting, we will then go to one of the capital\u2019s iconic bars to try out two spontaneously fermented beers-typical of Brussels -they are still brewed with wild yeast.\r\n\r\nAfterwards, we will savour the wonderful \u201cfrites\u201d or French fries, in a typical \u201cfrietkot\u201d (Frites stall), which is also the only left in the city centre that still fries potatoes in the traditional way We will certainly try them with a good sauce of our choice. It makes our mouths watering, doesn\u2019t it?\r\n\r\nWe finish our tour at a famous bar in the city centre, tasting two beers whose recipes were created by monks of the Trappist abbeys and are top-fermented beers.\r\n\r\nIf you want to spend a real gourmet weekend in Brussels, not only tasting beer, but also indulging in chocolates and fries, don\u2019t hesitate to book our chocolate, beer and fries tour of Brussels!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPractical information:\r\n\r\nPrice:\r\nAdults: 50\u20ac\r\nPrivate group: you can also book this activity in private for your group. Contact us by email.\r\n\r\nWhen:\r\nEvery Saturday.\r\n\r\nStarting time:\r\n3:00 pm\r\n\r\nMeeting point:\r\nThe meeting point is at Brussel\u2019s Grand-Place, in front of the city Hall. (Please arrive at least 10 minutes before departure time. You will recognise our guides carrying a WHITE umbrella with the Bravo Discovery logo)\r\n\r\nDuration:\r\nAbout 3 hours.\r\n\r\nLanguage:\r\nEnglish; French; Spanish\r\n\r\nIncluded:\r\nThe workshop fee includes everything from cooking gear to professional grade ingredients and complimentary hot chocolate with a recipe.\r\n\r\nNot included:\r\nAdditional food or drinks.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"de":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"it":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"sp":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"pt":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"},"cn":{"name":"Chocolate, Beer and Fries Tour of Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539560"}},"place":{"id":258936,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76, 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bravo Discovery vous offre un service de qualit\u00e9 sur toute la Belgique, avec l'\u00e9thique d'un tourisme responsable.\r\nNous travaillons en partenariat avec l'Office du Tourisme bruxellois (visit.brussels). Nos collaborateurs sont des guides professionnels et nous avons une \u00e9quipe de guides free-lance 