t de son imagination. A l\u2019occasion du 70\u00e8me anniversaire de sa disparition, p\u00e9dalez entre les fa\u00e7ades somptueuses et les d\u00e9corations florales appr\u00e9ci\u00e9es de l\u2019architecte. De Bruxelles \u00e0 Schaerbeek, d\u00e9couvrez \u00e0 travers son \u0153uvre, la vie et les id\u00e9es r\u00e9volutionnaires de ce jeune architecte.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.provelo.org\/events\/gustave-strauven-le-virtuose-de-lart-nouveau-6\/","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555589"},"nl":{"name":"Gustave Strauven - Le virtuose de l'Art nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.provelo.org\/events\/gustave-strauven-le-virtuose-de-lart-nouveau-6\/","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555589"},"en":{"name":"Gustave Strauven - Le virtuose de l'Art nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.provelo.org\/events\/gustave-strauven-le-virtuose-de-lart-nouveau-6\/","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555589"},"de":{"name":"Gustave Strauven - Le virtuose de l'Art nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.provelo.org\/events\/gustave-strauven-le-virtuose-de-lart-nouveau-6\/","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 73 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555589"},"it":{"name":"Gustave Strauven - Le virtuose de l'Art nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdesc