00e9alisa pour lui un magasin avec atelier \u00e0 l\u2019ombre de la cath\u00e9drale Saints-Michel-et-Gudule. La rue d\u2019Arenberg \u00e9tait alors connue pour ses commerces de luxe. En 1977, la famille Wolfers offrit aux Mus\u00e9es Royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire le mobilier int\u00e9rieur du magasin, tout en acajou. Depuis 2017, il est \u00e0 red\u00e9couvrir dans toute sa splendeur dans la salle Horta-Wolfers.\r\n\r\nTout comme \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, nous pouvons y admirer de c\u00e9l\u00e8bres bijoux con\u00e7us et r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par le ma\u00eetre bijoutier Philippe Wolfers. Mais d\u2019autres artistes art nouveau et art d\u00e9co y sont pr\u00e9sents. D\u00e9couvrons ainsi un haut lieu de l\u2019art belge. Par la m\u00eame occasion, cette collection t\u00e9moigne d\u2019une \u00e9poque riche en nouvelles technologies, industrie et entreprises, en m\u00eame temps que des premiers pas vers la mondialisation, d\u2019un renouveau politique et social, ainsi que du pass\u00e9 colonial de la Belgique. \r\n\r\nLes dimanches 30.04 \/ 25.06 \/ 27.08 \/ 29.10 \/ 31.12\r\nDe 14:00 \u00e0 15:30\r\n\r\n15 \u20ac \/ 10 (-19 ans & Museumpass)\r\n\r\nLieu de rendez-vous : Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"nl":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"en":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"de":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers (Magasin \u2018Wolfers Fr\u00e8res\u2019)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"it":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers (Magasin \u2018Wolfers Fr\u00e8res\u2019)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"sp":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers (Magasin \u2018Wolfers Fr\u00e8res\u2019)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"pt":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers (Magasin \u2018Wolfers Fr\u00e8res\u2019)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"},"cn":{"name":"Horta-Wolfers (Magasin \u2018Wolfers Fr\u00e8res\u2019)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","email":"public@mrah.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553102"}},"place":{"id":61,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez pour un fascinant voyage \u00e0 travers l'art et l'histoire. Venez fl\u00e2ner parmi les momies \u00e9gyptiennes et les silex pr\u00e9historiques, vous promener entre les verres anciens et prendre du recul pour mieux contempler d'impressionnantes tapisseries m\u00e9di\u00e9vales. Venez vous immerger dans le monde oriental en croisant des Bouddhas d'Asie et voyager jusqu'\u00e0 l'autre bout de la terre pour apercevoir une gigantesque statue de l'\u00eele de P\u00e2ques. La magnifique collection d'Art Nouveau vous attend au bout du voyage.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s. ","description_print":"Le Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire illustre les activit\u00e9s humaines et artistiques des cinq continents \u2013 hormis l\u2019Afrique noire \u2013, de la Pr\u00e9histoire \u00e0 nos jours. Les collections remplissent quatre b\u00e2timents et sont regroup\u00e9es en quatre d\u00e9partements: l\u2019Antiquit\u00e9, les civilisations extra-europ\u00e9ennes, l\u2019arch\u00e9ologie nationale et les arts d\u00e9coratifs europ\u00e9ens.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kmkg.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Maak een wereldreis door de geschiedenis! Wandel van prehistorische vuistbijlen naar Egyptische mummies. Snuistert tussen betoverende glas en zet een stap achteruit om de indrukwekkende Brusselse wandtapijten te bekijken. Ga de oosterse toer op tussen de Aziatische boeddha\u2019s en steek de Atlantische Oceaan over om Kuifjes \u2018beeldje met het gebroken oor\u2019. En dan is er nog de mooie collectie van Belgische art nouveau\u2026 U komt ogen en oren te kort!\r\n\r\nHet Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis maakt deel uit van de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis (KMKG) die ook het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM), de Hallepoort en de Musea van het Verre Oosten (gesloten voor renovatie) bundelen.","description_print":"Het Jubelparkmuseum kan bogen op een imposante collectie kunstschatten en archeologische vondsten afkomstig uit de vijf continenten \u2013 met uitzondering van Zwart-Afrika \u2013 van de prehistorie tot op heden. De verzamelingen vullen vier gebouwen en zijn ingedeeld in evenveel departementen: Oudheid (het Nabije Oosten, Egypte, Griekenland, Rome en Byzantium), Niet-Europese Beschavingen (Islam, Azi\u00eb, Polynesi\u00eb & Micronesi\u00eb en Amerika), Nationale Archeologie en Europese Sierkunsten.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & History Museum (RMAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Embark on a fascinating journey through art and history! Come and stroll among the prehistoric flints and Egyptian mummies, walk between the ancient glasses and stand back to contemplate the impressive medieval tapestries. Immerse yourself in the oriental world as you pass Asian Buddhas and travel to the other side of the world to see a gigantic statue from Easter Island. You still have to admire the magnificent collection of Belgian Art Nouveau...\r\n\r\nThe Art & History Museum is part of the Royal Museums of Art and History (RMAH) that also cover the Musical Instruments Museum (MIM), Halle Gate and the Museums of the Far East (currently closed for renovation).","description_print":"The Cinquantenaire Museum is the headquarters of the Royal Museums of Art and History. It was erected at the end of the nineteenth century and is one of the most extensive museums in Belgium. The collections are divided according to four main themes: 1) National Archaeology; 2) Antiquity; 3) European Decorative Art; 4) Non-European Civilizations.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Cinquantenaire-Museum, gelegen im Br\u00fcsseler Jubelpark, ist Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte und bietet einen umfassenden und vielseitigen \u00dcberblick \u00fcber die Geschichte von den Hochkulturen der Antike bis hin zu den Kunststr\u00f6mungen der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAntike Sammlungen: \r\nDie antiken Sammlungen befassen sich mit den untergegangenen Hochkulturen von \u00c4gypten (Neuheit: das Grabmal von Nakht), Mesopotamien, Griechenland und Rom. Gezeigt werden au\u00dferdem die gro\u00dfen Kunststr\u00f6mungen Europas vom 10. Jahrhundert bis heute. Wandteppiche, Altaraufs\u00e4tze, Spitze, Goldschmiedekunst und Porzellan geh\u00f6ren zu den kostbaren H\u00f6hepunkten der Ausstellung.\r\n\r\nVon Mikronesien bis Amerika: \r\nDie nicht-europ\u00e4ischen Werke laden ihrerseits auf eine Reise ein: nach Mikronesien, Polynesien, Indien, S\u00fcdostasien, China und ins pr\u00e4kolumbische Amerika. In den eindrucksvollen Arch\u00e4ologie-S\u00e4len wird der Geschichte der Region von der Vorgeschichte bis zur Epoche der Merowinger neues Leben eingehaucht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Arte & Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore del complesso del Cinquantenario, il Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire vi invita a viaggiatore attraverso i continenti dalla Preistoria al XX secolo. \r\n\r\n\r\nLe sue ricche collezioni sono suddivise in quattro grandi sezioni :\r\n\r\n- L'Antichit\u00e0 dove sono presentate le grandi civilt\u00e0 scomparse dell'Egitto, della Mesopotamia, della Grecia e di Roma.\r\n- Le Arti decorative europee dove scoprire le correnti artistiche dal X secolo ai giorni nostri.\r\n- Le Civilt\u00e0 non europee che invitano al viaggio: India, Sudest asiatico, Cina, America precolombiana.\r\n- L'archeologia nazionale per rivivere il passato delle nostre regioni, dalla Preistoria al periodo merovingio.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Arte e Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ad\u00e9ntrate en este edificio hist\u00f3rico, uno de los mayores museos de B\u00e9lgica erigido por el anterior rey belga Leopoldo II. Descubre una gran cantidad de objetos desde la prehistoria hasta la antig\u00fcedad y de las artes aplicadas europeas hasta una amplia colecci\u00f3n de arte no europea. Explora todo, incluyendo las interesantes exposiciones temporales, conferencias y otras actividades. Desafortunadamente, la p\u00e1gina web no es tan amplia como para mostrar toda nuestra colecci\u00f3n, compuesta por miles de tesoros del arte y objetos hist\u00f3ricos. Sin embargo, esperamos que nos visites y disfrutes descubriendo o redescubriendo el inmenso patrimonio que gestionamos y exhibimos. De hecho, para nosotros el arte y la historia no son muerte y temas pasados, si no una viva y constante fuente de inspiraci\u00f3n y diversi\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte e Historia es parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia(MRAH), que incluye el Museo de Instrumentos Musicales(MIM), la Puerta de Hal y los Museos del Lejano Oriente(recientemente cerrado por renovaciones).\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Da arqueologia nacional \u00e0s artes decorativas europeias, passando pela antiguidade cl\u00e1ssica e pelas civiliza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o europeias, embarque numa fascinante viagem atrav\u00e9s da arte e da hist\u00f3ria num edif\u00edcio magn\u00edfico criado por L\u00e9opold II no parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio em Bruxelas.\r\n\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio muda de pele e torna-se o Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria!\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio desenvolveu um trabalho de reflex\u00e3o sobre a sua imagem. Este resultou numa campanha de reorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o global da institui\u00e7\u00e3o. Come\u00e7ou assim uma reconquista museogr\u00e1fica: a decis\u00e3o de organizar exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias baseadas nas pr\u00f3prias cole\u00e7\u00f5es do museu e de renovar progressivamente as salas permanentes, come\u00e7ando pelo armaz\u00e9m Wolfers, que foi a primeira etapa de uma s\u00e9rie de outras renova\u00e7\u00f5es (salas Egito, salas s\u00e9culos XIX e XX, maqueta de Roma\u2026) que atingem rapidamente a sua velocidade de cruzeiro. O\r\n- Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria pertence aos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria, que englobam, para al\u00e9m deste, o MIM (Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais), a Porta de Hal e os Museus do Extremo Oriente, atualmente encerrados.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"],"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"],"de":["Osten"],"it":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12,"location":{"lat":50.83935087,"lon":4.3917188},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-07T13:37:49+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":61,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez pour un fascinant voyage \u00e0 travers l'art et l'histoire. Venez fl\u00e2ner parmi les momies \u00e9gyptiennes et les silex pr\u00e9historiques, vous promener entre les verres anciens et prendre du recul pour mieux contempler d'impressionnantes tapisseries m\u00e9di\u00e9vales. Venez vous immerger dans le monde oriental en croisant des Bouddhas d'Asie et voyager jusqu'\u00e0 l'autre bout de la terre pour apercevoir une gigantesque statue de l'\u00eele de P\u00e2ques. La magnifique collection d'Art Nouveau vous attend au bout du voyage.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s. ","description_print":"Le Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire illustre les activit\u00e9s humaines et artistiques des cinq continents \u2013 hormis l\u2019Afrique noire \u2013, de la Pr\u00e9histoire \u00e0 nos jours. Les collections remplissent quatre b\u00e2timents et sont regroup\u00e9es en quatre d\u00e9partements: l\u2019Antiquit\u00e9, les civilisations extra-europ\u00e9ennes, l\u2019arch\u00e9ologie nationale et les arts d\u00e9coratifs europ\u00e9ens.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kmkg.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Maak een wereldreis door de geschiedenis! Wandel van prehistorische vuistbijlen naar Egyptische mummies. Snuistert tussen betoverende glas en zet een stap achteruit om de indrukwekkende Brusselse wandtapijten te bekijken. Ga de oosterse toer op tussen de Aziatische boeddha\u2019s en steek de Atlantische Oceaan over om Kuifjes \u2018beeldje met het gebroken oor\u2019. En dan is er nog de mooie collectie van Belgische art nouveau\u2026 U komt ogen en oren te kort!\r\n\r\nHet Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis maakt deel uit van de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis (KMKG) die ook het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM), de Hallepoort en de Musea van het Verre Oosten (gesloten voor renovatie) bundelen.","description_print":"Het Jubelparkmuseum kan bogen op een imposante collectie kunstschatten en archeologische vondsten afkomstig uit de vijf continenten \u2013 met uitzondering van Zwart-Afrika \u2013 van de prehistorie tot op heden. De verzamelingen vullen vier gebouwen en zijn ingedeeld in evenveel departementen: Oudheid (het Nabije Oosten, Egypte, Griekenland, Rome en Byzantium), Niet-Europese Beschavingen (Islam, Azi\u00eb, Polynesi\u00eb & Micronesi\u00eb en Amerika), Nationale Archeologie en Europese Sierkunsten.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & History Museum (RMAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Embark on a fascinating journey through art and history! Come and stroll among the prehistoric flints and Egyptian mummies, walk between the ancient glasses and stand back to contemplate the impressive medieval tapestries. Immerse yourself in the oriental world as you pass Asian Buddhas and travel to the other side of the world to see a gigantic statue from Easter Island. You still have to admire the magnificent collection of Belgian Art Nouveau...\r\n\r\nThe Art & History Museum is part of the Royal Museums of Art and History (RMAH) that also cover the Musical Instruments Museum (MIM), Halle Gate and the Museums of the Far East (currently closed for renovation).","description_print":"The Cinquantenaire Museum is the headquarters of the Royal Museums of Art and History. It was erected at the end of the nineteenth century and is one of the most extensive museums in Belgium. The collections are divided according to four main themes: 1) National Archaeology; 2) Antiquity; 3) European Decorative Art; 4) Non-European Civilizations.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Cinquantenaire-Museum, gelegen im Br\u00fcsseler Jubelpark, ist Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte und bietet einen umfassenden und vielseitigen \u00dcberblick \u00fcber die Geschichte von den Hochkulturen der Antike bis hin zu den Kunststr\u00f6mungen der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAntike Sammlungen: \r\nDie antiken Sammlungen befassen sich mit den untergegangenen Hochkulturen von \u00c4gypten (Neuheit: das Grabmal von Nakht), Mesopotamien, Griechenland und Rom. Gezeigt werden au\u00dferdem die gro\u00dfen Kunststr\u00f6mungen Europas vom 10. Jahrhundert bis heute. Wandteppiche, Altaraufs\u00e4tze, Spitze, Goldschmiedekunst und Porzellan geh\u00f6ren zu den kostbaren H\u00f6hepunkten der Ausstellung.\r\n\r\nVon Mikronesien bis Amerika: \r\nDie nicht-europ\u00e4ischen Werke laden ihrerseits auf eine Reise ein: nach Mikronesien, Polynesien, Indien, S\u00fcdostasien, China und ins pr\u00e4kolumbische Amerika. In den eindrucksvollen Arch\u00e4ologie-S\u00e4len wird der Geschichte der Region von der Vorgeschichte bis zur Epoche der Merowinger neues Leben eingehaucht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Arte & Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore del complesso del Cinquantenario, il Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire vi invita a viaggiatore attraverso i continenti dalla Preistoria al XX secolo. \r\n\r\n\r\nLe sue ricche collezioni sono suddivise in quattro grandi sezioni :\r\n\r\n- L'Antichit\u00e0 dove sono presentate le grandi civilt\u00e0 scomparse dell'Egitto, della Mesopotamia, della Grecia e di Roma.\r\n- Le Arti decorative europee dove scoprire le correnti artistiche dal X secolo ai giorni nostri.\r\n- Le Civilt\u00e0 non europee che invitano al viaggio: India, Sudest asiatico, Cina, America precolombiana.\r\n- L'archeologia nazionale per rivivere il passato delle nostre regioni, dalla Preistoria al periodo merovingio.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Arte e Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ad\u00e9ntrate en este edificio hist\u00f3rico, uno de los mayores museos de B\u00e9lgica erigido por el anterior rey belga Leopoldo II. Descubre una gran cantidad de objetos desde la prehistoria hasta la antig\u00fcedad y de las artes aplicadas europeas hasta una amplia colecci\u00f3n de arte no europea. Explora todo, incluyendo las interesantes exposiciones temporales, conferencias y otras actividades. Desafortunadamente, la p\u00e1gina web no es tan amplia como para mostrar toda nuestra colecci\u00f3n, compuesta por miles de tesoros del arte y objetos hist\u00f3ricos. Sin embargo, esperamos que nos visites y disfrutes descubriendo o redescubriendo el inmenso patrimonio que gestionamos y exhibimos. De hecho, para nosotros el arte y la historia no son muerte y temas pasados, si no una viva y constante fuente de inspiraci\u00f3n y diversi\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte e Historia es parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia(MRAH), que incluye el Museo de Instrumentos Musicales(MIM), la Puerta de Hal y los Museos del Lejano Oriente(recientemente cerrado por renovaciones).\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Da arqueologia nacional \u00e0s artes decorativas europeias, passando pela antiguidade cl\u00e1ssica e pelas civiliza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o europeias, embarque numa fascinante viagem atrav\u00e9s da arte e da hist\u00f3ria num edif\u00edcio magn\u00edfico criado por L\u00e9opold II no parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio em Bruxelas.\r\n\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio muda de pele e torna-se o Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria!\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio desenvolveu um trabalho de reflex\u00e3o sobre a sua imagem. Este resultou numa campanha de reorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o global da institui\u00e7\u00e3o. Come\u00e7ou assim uma reconquista museogr\u00e1fica: a decis\u00e3o de organizar exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias baseadas nas pr\u00f3prias cole\u00e7\u00f5es do museu e de renovar progressivamente as salas permanentes, come\u00e7ando pelo armaz\u00e9m Wolfers, que foi a primeira etapa de uma s\u00e9rie de outras renova\u00e7\u00f5es (salas Egito, salas s\u00e9culos XIX e XX, maqueta de Roma\u2026) que atingem rapidamente a sua velocidade de cruzeiro. O\r\n- Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria pertence aos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria, que englobam, para al\u00e9m deste, o MIM (Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais), a Porta de Hal e os Museus do Extremo Oriente, atualmente encerrados.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12,"location":{"lat":50.83935087,"lon":4.3917188},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-07T13:37:49+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/b8b2577aadbb11dd6954fe26d3623184d7ac8d39.jpg","width":709,"height":530,"ratio":1.34,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Horta-Wolfers","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-04-30","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-06-25","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-08-27","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-10-29","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-12-31","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":15}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[322],"translations":{"fr":["Art Nouveau & Art D\u00e9co"],"nl":["Art nouveau & art deco"],"en":["Art Nouveau &  Art D\u00e9co"],"de":["Jugendstil & Art d\u00e9co"],"it":["Art Nouveau e Art D\u00e9co"],"sp":["Art nouveau y art d\u00e9co"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":["annee_art_nouveau"],"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Cane guida","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Perros gu\u00eda","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-07T13:37:49+02:00","published_at":"2023-03-08T17:02:55+01:00","backoffice_id":273102,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.20107818794899},{"id":541835,"date_start":"2022-09-18","date_end":"2023-06-18","date_next":"2023-04-30","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"],"de":["Klassisch"],"it":["Classica"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022-2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Apr\u00e8s un petit repos estival, nous avons finalis\u00e9 durant l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 le programme de la nouvelle saison jusqu\u2019en Juin 2023: \r\nEn septembre, nouvelle salle, nouveau d\u00e9cor, nouvelle saison \u201cEscapades\u201d \u00e0 la Tricoterie.  \r\nLa Tricoterie, l\u2019endroit Saint-Gillois o\u00f9 l\u2019on fabrique des liens sera notre nouveau repaire pour vous pr\u00e9senter neuf concerts de septembre \u00e0 juin.","longdescr":"Concerts Escapades est une r\u00e9gie du CRIT de l\u2019ASBL l\u2019\u00c9quipe qui organise des concerts de musique classique, en collaboration avec \u201cMusic Project For Brussels\u201d et la prison de Forest.\r\n- Le 18 septembre \u00e0 20H30, le premier concert, Lubimov+, nom de l\u2019exceptionnel pianiste russe qui a poursuivi son jeu malgr\u00e9 la police lors d\u2019un concert \u00e0 Moscou le 13 avril dernier. Il nous jouera sans a priori des pi\u00e8ces de Silvestrov compositeur ukrainien, Arvo Part l\u2019estonien, Schubert et Haydn les autrichiens. \r\nNous continuerons avec Joy+ le 16 octobre, avec Yu Sheng Jiang, formant un groupe de jazz avec deux autres acolytes ainsi que le quatuor \u00e0 cordes portugais Quiron.\r\n- Le 13 novembre, Belgo+, place aux compositeurs belges Lekeu et Ysaye. \r\nEnfin, le 11 d\u00e9cembre, le concert O+, qui console l\u2019\u00e2me, chasse la m\u00e9lancolie par le rem\u00e8de du oud, du th\u00e9orbe et luth avec Sofie Vanden Eynde et Saad Mahmoud Jawad.\r\n- En 2023, nous commen\u00e7ons l'ann\u00e9e avec le concert de Silvestrov+. \r\nConcert classique o\u00f9 la po\u00e9sie s\u2019invite, sublim\u00e9e par la voix de Viktoria Vitrenko et le talent du pianiste d\u2019Alexei Lubimov. Concert SILVESTROV+ le 19 janvier \u00e0 20h30 \u00e0 la Tricoterie.\r\n- En Fevrier, mois de la f\u00eate des amoureux oblige, concert AMOR XXX se d\u00e9roulera le dimanche 12 f\u00e9vrier \u00e0 20h30 \u00e0 la Tricoterie. Entrez dans le jeu amoureux au temps des grandes cours europ\u00e9ennes. Rev\u00eatez vos plus beaux atours, \u00e9veillez vos sens et laissez-vous charmer par la volupt\u00e9 de IRIS ENSEMBLE et par la puret\u00e9 de la voix de Soetkin ELBERS. Musique baroque au programme.\r\n- En Avril : [WO]MAN + . Pensez aux compositeurs et compositrices classiques\u2026 Combien sont des femmes ? Est-ce juste ? Concerts Escapades pense que non !\r\nLe concert (Wo)man + met les femmes \u00e0 l\u2019honneur le dimanche 02 avril \u00e0 20H30, \u00e0 la Tricoterie.\r\nTant\u00f4t romantique avec Clara Schumann, tant\u00f4t \"m\u00e9tal\" avec Galina Ustvolskaya, la minimaliste Meredith Monk ou encore la beaut\u00e9 classique d\u2019H\u00e9l\u00e8ne de Montgeroult, ce concert sera interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par les mains expertes et d\u00e9licates de beaux pianistes masculins.\r\n- En Mai : FAR OUT EAST. Sortez vos Tigres et Dragons, manga, K-pop  : Partez en voyage pour l'extr\u00eame orient avec le concert FAR OUT EAST, le dimanche 14 mai 2023 \u00e0 20h30 \u00e0 La Tricoterie.\r\nD\u00e9monstration de Kung Fu inclus\r\nLes Escapadistes donnent \u00e0 nouveau une sc\u00e8ne aux talents asiatiques. Si les musiciens d'Extr\u00eame-Orient gagnent des prix lors de nombreux concours renomm\u00e9s, il leur est plus difficile de s'imposer dans les salles de concert et les maisons traditionnelles de Belgique. Les compositeurs asiatiques ne parviennent pas encore \u00e0 s'imposer en Occident.... \r\nFAR OUT EAST pr\u00e9sente un programme oriental avec des \u0153uvres du d\u00e9but du 20e si\u00e8cle \u00e0 nos jours, le tout agr\u00e9ment\u00e9 d'une d\u00e9monstration kung-fu qui sera notre plus de la soir\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nUNSUK CHIN - Etudes pour piano par Sergey REDKIN (piano)\r\nATSUHIKO GONDAI - THELOS pour alto jou\u00e9 par Vincent HEPP (alto)\r\nTAN DUN - Eight Memories in Watercolour jou\u00e9 par Yu-Fen CHANG (piano)\r\nSIFU SING TRAN  - ma\u00eetre de kung-fu wing chun","performers":"Concert [WO]MAN +. 2 avril 2023 \u00e0 20h30\r\nmusiciens: Jean-Philippe Collard-Neven, Stephane Ginsburgh, Nikolaas Kende, Marco Mantovani\r\n\r\nConcert Far OUT EAST+\r\nmusiciens : Sergey REDKIN (piano), Vincent HEPP (alto),  Yu-Fen CHANG (piano)\r\nchor\u00e9graphie Kun fu :Si sing Tran\r\nextra : Yijun Chen(guitare) Hsuan-hui FANG (Voice)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"nl":{"name":"Nieuw seizoen 2022-2023 Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Na een korte zomerstop hebben we het programma tot juni 2023 van het nieuwe seizoen afgerond: \r\nIn september, nieuwe zaal, nieuw scene, een nieuw seizoen \u201cEscapades\u201d bij La Tricoterie.  \r\nLa Tricoterie, de plaats in Sint-Gillis waar verbinding gebeurt, wordt onze nieuwe ontmoetingsplaats om van september tot juni negen concerten voor te stellen.","longdescr":"Concerts Escapades is een concertmanagement van het CRIT van de VZW l'\u00c9quipe dat klassieke muziekconcerten organiseert in samenwerking met \"Music Project For Brussels\" en de gevangenis van Vorst.\r\n- Op 18 december om 20.30 uur is het eerste concert, Lubimov+, genoemd naar de uitzonderlijke Russische pianist die ondanks de politie doorging met spelen tijdens een concert in Moskou op 13 april. Hij zal stukken spelen van de Oekra\u00efense componist Silvestrov, de Estse Arvo Part, de \u2018Oostenrijkers\u2019 Schubert en Haydn.\r\nWe gaan verder met Joy+ op 16 oktober, met Yusheng Jiang, die met twee acolieten een jazztrio vormt , en het Portugese strijkkwartet Quiron.\r\n- Op 13 november staan de Belgische componisten Lekeu en Ysaye op het programma van Belgo+. \r\n- Op 11 december ten slotte, het O+ concert, dat de ziel troost en de melancholie verdrijft met de remedie van de oud, de theorbe en de luit met Sofie Vanden Eynde en Saad Mahmoud Jawad.\r\n\r\n- In 2023 beginnen we het jaar met het Silvestrov+ concert. Een piano en zangconcert met po\u00ebzie, versterkt door de stem van Viktoria Vitrenko en het talent van pianist Alexei Lubimov. Concert Silvestrov+ op 19 januari om 20.30 uur in de Tricoterie.\r\n\r\n- In februari, de maand van de geliefden, zal het Amor XXX concert op zondag 12 februari om 20u30 in de Tricoterie plaatsvinden.  Wees uw meest verleidelijke zelf, wakker uw zintuigen aan en laat u charmeren door de klankvolheid van het Iris Ensemble en de zuivere stem van Soetkin Elbers. Barokmuziek op het programma. in april: [WO]MAN +. Beeldt U even klassieke componisten in...\r\nHoeveel vrouwen waren er onder hen ?\r\nKlinkt u dat juist\/correct ?\r\nConcerts Escapades denkt van niet!\r\n\r\n- In April : Het (Wo)man + concert op zondag 2 April bij de Tricoterie zal hen exclusieve aandacht geven.\r\nWeze het eerder romantisch met Clara Schumann, eerder metal met Galina Ustvolskaya of nog: minimal met Meredith Monk of de klassieke schoonheid van H\u00e9l\u00e8ne de Montgeroult ! De musici voor dit concert zijn gevoelige experten in hun muziek, maar bovenal zijn het \u201cschoon jongens\u201d.\r\n\r\n- In Mei : Ontwaak de Tijger of Draak in jezelf, breng je Manga en je K-Pop-choreografie\u00ebn mee voor een reis naar het Verre Oosten, het FAR OUT EAST + concert, op zondag 14 mei 2023 om 20.30 uur in La Tricoterie.\r\nKung Fu-demonstratie inbegrepen\r\n\r\nAziatische componisten en muzikanten \r\nDe Escapadisten geven een podium aan Aziatisch talent. Hoewel musici uit het Verre Oosten veren winnen op tal van gerenommeerde wedstrijden, is het voor hen moeilijker om zich te vestigen in de Belgische concertzalen en traditionele huizen. Ook Aziatische componisten slagen er niet in hun stempel te drukken op het West.... FAR OUT EAST brengt een oosters programma met werken van het begin van de 20ste eeuw tot vandaag, met een kung fu intermezzo.\r\n\r\nPROGRAMMA:\r\nUNSUK CHIN - Etudes for piano door Sergey REDKIN (piano)\r\nATSUHIKO GONDAI - THELOS voor altviool door Vincent HEPP (altviool)\r\nTAN DUN - Eight Memories in Watercolor door Yu-Fen CHANG (piano)\r\nSIFU SING TRAN - kung-fu meester Wing Chun","performers":"Concert [WO]MAN + . 2 april 2023 om 20.30 uur ; Jean-Philippe Collard-Neven, Stephane Ginsburgh, Nikolaas Kende, Marco Mantovani\r\n\r\nConcert FAR OUT EAST+  15 Mei 2023 om 20h30 uur\r\nmuzikanten : Sergey REDKIN (piano), Vincent HEPP (alto),  Yu-Fen CHANG (piano)\r\nchoreografie  Kun fu :Si sing Tran\r\nextra : Yijun Chen(guitare) Hsuan-hui FANG (Voice)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"en":{"name":"New Season 2022-2023 Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"de":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022_2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"it":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022_2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"sp":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022_2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"pt":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022_2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"},"cn":{"name":"Nouvelle Saison 2022_2023  Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=LATRICOTERIE&s=DD20E1CA-2A64-C646-56FF-A1B47677F609&fbclid=IwAR1U9Awy7uRFFfb2tw18zsy4kpAs2yCyrb9bTpRBtS8ARcunywQNwYCgeQI","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541835"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","addre