"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"],"de":["Norden"],"it":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":663,"location":{"lat":50.85951067,"lon":4.37063079},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-14T03:07:24+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":222932,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, anim\u00e9e par le Service Culture fran\u00e7aise de la Commune de Schaerbeek, est un espace singulier dont les activit\u00e9s sont principalement ax\u00e9es sur la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine dans le domaine des arts plastiques avec un important programme de m\u00e9diation permettant l\u2019acc\u00e8s de l\u2019art contemporain \u00e0 tous.\r\n\r\nLa MA conna\u00eet une riche activit\u00e9 artistique depuis les ann\u00e9es \u201950, \u00e9poque \u00e0 laquelle la commune rach\u00e8te le b\u00e2timent. En 2005, elle se voit prendre un premier tournant en proposant aux artistes de travailler in situ, afin d\u2019\u00e9tablir une r\u00e9elle coh\u00e9rence entre l\u2019\u0153uvre et la Maison.\r\nEt finalement, c\u2019est en 2016 que la Commune de Schaerbeek d\u00e9cide de la positionner dans le domaine des arts plastiques, contemporains et num\u00e9riques comme un lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de diffusion et de rayonnement culturel.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Huis der Kunsten","address_street_name":"Haachtsesteenweg","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Haachtsesteenweg, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, geanimeerd door de dienst Franstalige Cultuur van de gemeente Schaarbeek, is een heel bijzondere plek. De activiteiten zijn vooral gericht op hedendaagse creativiteit in de plastische kunsten.\r\n\r\nIn La Maison des Arts heerst reeds sedert 1950 ( datum waarop de gemeente het huis aankocht) een ruime artistieke activiteit. In 2005 is er een belangrijke ontwikkeling : het voorstel aan de kunstenaars om ter plaatse te werken, teneinde een echte samenhang te bereiken tussen het werk en het Huis. Uiteindelijk beslist de Gemeente Schaarbeek er een echte broeikast van te maken in het domein van de beeldende kunsten, een bron van schepping, verspreiding en culturele uitstraling.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The MdA is run and staffed by the Francophone Cultural Service of Schaerbeek Council and is a unique place whose activities are mainly concerned with the creation of works of contemporary art with a significant partnership programme that promotes access for all to contemporary art.\r\n\r\nThe MdA has hosted a rich programme of artistic activities since the 1950s when the building was purchased by Schaerbeek Council. In 2005, the MdA began a programme of inviting artists to work in building, to build more coherence between their works of art and the MdA.\r\n\r\nMost recently, in 2016, Schaerbeek Council decided to position the MdA as a centre for the creation, diffusion and promotion of culture, contemporary two-dimensional, three-dimensional and digital art.\r\nThe MdA\u2019s educational and social approach aims to promoting equality of access to art and its introduction to new audiences.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":663,"location":{"lat":50.85951067,"lon":4.37063079},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-14T03:07:24+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/9e480b689c812542f9a5b18e23e0178d7249909c.jpg","width":2126,"height":1417,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null}}},{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/4afadc42b2032468a38f8f20c548b3cf6a6b2560.jpg","width":1500,"height":2118,"ratio":0.71,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"de":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"After Five","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-03-09","doors":null,"start":"17:00:00","end":"22:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-04-13","doors":null,"start":"17:00:00","end":"22:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-05-11","doors":null,"start":"17:00:00","end":"22:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-04-14T03:07:24+02:00","published_at":"2023-02-10T13:27:02+01:00","backoffice_id":271472,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.31663808386433},{"id":553505,"date_start":"2023-03-30","date_end":"2023-06-17","date_next":"2023-05-11","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[255],"translations":{"fr":["Visites d'expositions"],"nl":["Tentoonstelling"],"en":["Exhibition guided tours"],"de":["Besuche von Ausstellungen"],"it":["Visite a esposizioni"],"sp":["Visitas a las exposiciones"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Visites guid\u00e9es - Style Congo","shortdescr":"Le CIVA propose une s\u00e9rie de visites guid\u00e9es uniques de l\u2019exposition \u00ab Style Congo, Heritage & Heresy \u00bb par les artistes et curateurs\/trices du projet. Ces tours guid\u00e9s sont l\u2019occasion pour les experts\/tes de partager leur vision personnelle de l\u2019exposition.","longdescr":"\u00ab Style Congo, Heritage & Heresy \u00bb explore les politiques de repr\u00e9sentation et d'appropriation culturelles \u00e0 travers des interventions artistiques et architecturales contemporaines ainsi que des documents et mat\u00e9riaux historiques issus des collections du CIVA. L'exposition propose une chronique visuelle de la repr\u00e9sentation du Congo lors des expositions internationales organis\u00e9es entre 1885 et 1958, en prenant comme point d\u2019appui l'Art nouveau. Ce mouvement - appel\u00e9 \u00e0 l'\u00e9poque \"Style Congo\" - co\u00efncide avec l'exploitation du Congo par le roi L\u00e9opold II et refl\u00e8te une fascination g\u00e9n\u00e9ralis\u00e9e pour les mat\u00e9riaux et les formes \"exotiques\".\r\n\r\nLes \u0153uvres de l'exposition remettent en question et d\u00e9stabilisent les histoires canoniques et les racines coloniales de cet h\u00e9ritage. En examinant les marques de la colonisation dans la ville de Bruxelles et dans le paysage urbain congolais, ils pr\u00e9sentent une r\u00e9signification d\u00e9coloniale des espaces priv\u00e9s et publics, et cherchent \u00e0 r\u00e9\u00e9crire les marges de l'histoire au centre.","performers":"Sammy Baloji, Johnny Leya, Silvia Franschini, Nikolaus Hirsch, Johan Lagae, Estelle Lecaille","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"nl":{"name":"Rondleidingen - Style Congo","shortdescr":"CIVA biedt een reeks unieke rondleidingen in de tentoonstelling \u201cStyle Congo, Heritage & Heresy\u201d door de kunstenaars en curatoren van het project. Tijdens deze rondleidingen delen de deskundigen hun persoonlijke visie op de tentoonstelling.","longdescr":"\"Style Congo. Heritage and Heresy\" verkent de politiek van culturele representatie en toe-eigening aan de hand van zowel hedendaagse artistieke en architecturale interventies als historische documenten en materiaal uit de CIVA-collecties. De tentoonstelling brengt een visuele kroniek van de vertegenwoordiging van Congo op wereldtentoonstellingen die tussen 1885 en 1958 werden georganiseerd en neemt daarbij de art nouveau als ankerpunt. Die stroming - destijds ook wel Congostijl genoemd - viel samen met de exploitatie van Congo door koning Leopold II en weerspiegelt een wijdverbreide fascinatie voor \"exotische\" materialen en vormen.\r\n\r\nDe werken in de tentoonstelling bevragen en destabiliseren de canonieke geschiedenissen en koloniale wortels van dit erfgoed. Door de sporen van de kolonisatie in de stad Brussel en in het Congolese stedelijke landschap te onderzoeken, vormen ze een dekoloniale herschikking van private en publieke ruimtes, waarbij getracht wordt de marges van de geschiedenis te herschrijven naar het centrum.","performers":"Sammy Baloji, Johnny Leya, Silvia Franschini, Nikolaus Hirsch, Johan Lagae, Estelle Lecaille","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"en":{"name":"Guided tours - Style Congo. Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":"CIVA offers a series of unique guided tours of the exhibition \u201cStyle Congo, Heritage & Heresy\u201d by the artists and curators of the project. These guided tours are an opportunity for the experts to share their personal vision of the exhibition.","longdescr":"\u201cStyle Congo. Heritage and Heresy\u201d explores the politics of cultural representation and appropriation through contemporary artistic and architectural interventions as well as historic documents and materials from CIVA's collections. The exhibition visually chronicles the representation of Congo in international expositions held between 1885 and 1958, using Art Nouveau as its anchor point. The movement\u2014at the time also called Style Congo\u2014coincided with King Leopold II\u2019s exploitation of the Congo and reflects a widespread fascination with \u201cexotic\u201d materials and forms.\r\n\r\nThe works in the exhibition question and destabilize canonical histories and the colonial roots of this heritage. By examining marks of colonization in the city of Brussels and in the Congolese urban landscape, they present a decolonial resignification of private and public spaces, seeking to rewrite the margins of history into the center.\r\n\r\nCIVA, KANAL-Centre Pompidou, Living Traces, Twenty Nine Studio\r\nSammy Baloji, Silvia Franceschini, Nikolaus Hirsch, Estelle Lecaille, Judith Barry, Rossella Biscotti, Peggy Buth, Ayoh Kr\u00e9 Duch\u00e2telet, Jean Katambayi, Johan Lagae & Paoletta Holst, Chrystel Mukeba, Daniela Ortiz, Ruth Sacks, Traumnovelle","performers":"Sammy Baloji, Johnny Leya, Silvia Franschini, Nikolaus Hirsch, Johan Lagae, Estelle Lecaille","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"de":{"name":"VISITES GUID\u00c9ES - Style Congo Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"it":{"name":"VISITES GUID\u00c9ES - Style Congo Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"sp":{"name":"VISITES GUID\u00c9ES - Style Congo Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"pt":{"name":"VISITES GUID\u00c9ES - Style Congo Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"},"cn":{"name":"VISITES GUID\u00c9ES - Style Congo Heritage & Heresy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553505"}},"place":{"id":235577,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"fr":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"],"en":["Flagey"],"de":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"],"de":["S\u00fcden"],"it":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-23T03:06:35+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:20+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":235577,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'E